# Volume III: predetermined ordinary or explicitly fictional truths precede clues.
D.update({
13:[('A familiar background sound proves the transmitter is at that sound’s source.','Suara latar yang dikenali membuktikan pemancar berada di sumber suara itu.'),('A broadcast preceding a disappearance establishes supernatural prediction.','Siaran sebelum hilangnya seseorang memastikan ramalan gaib.'),('A historical frequency identifies the current operator.','Frekuensi historis mengidentifikasi operator saat ini.'),('An unexplained signal requires an extraordinary cause.','Sinyal belum terjelaskan memerlukan sebab luar biasa.'),('One reflected bearing uniquely fixes the origin.','Satu arah pantulan menetapkan asal secara unik.'),('A witness’s technical speculation is a verified project record.','Spekulasi teknis saksi adalah catatan proyek terverifikasi.'),('A scheduled name alone establishes the missing person’s location.','Nama terjadwal saja memastikan lokasi orang hilang.'),('Every archive label proves current government involvement.','Semua label arsip membuktikan keterlibatan pemerintah saat ini.')],
14:[('A rehabilitation history identifies criminal intent.','Riwayat rehabilitasi mengidentifikasi niat kriminal.'),('Handwriting resemblance uniquely identifies an author.','Kemiripan tulisan mengidentifikasi penulis secara unik.'),('A threatening letter proves its recipient selected the next target.','Surat ancaman membuktikan penerimanya memilih target berikutnya.'),('The order must reflect personal revenge rather than access to records.','Urutan pasti mencerminkan dendam pribadi, bukan akses catatan.'),('An old disappearance proves the former patient is the perpetrator.','Hilangnya pasien lama membuktikan mantan pasien itu pelaku.'),('A behavioral hypothesis replaces independently checked opportunity.','Hipotesis perilaku menggantikan kesempatan yang diperiksa independen.'),('All former patients knew every confidential incident role.','Semua mantan pasien mengetahui semua peran insiden rahasia.'),('A prior grievance alone establishes present conduct.','Keluhan lama saja memastikan tindakan saat ini.')],
15:[('Advance detail must be supernatural prediction.','Detail lebih awal pasti ramalan gaib.'),('An early false alarm proves there can be no later fire.','Alarm keliru awal membuktikan tidak mungkin ada kebakaran belakangan.'),('An unregistered device alone identifies the caller.','Perangkat tidak terdaftar saja mengidentifikasi penelepon.'),('All building systems share a reliable clock without verification.','Semua sistem gedung berbagi jam andal tanpa verifikasi.'),('A disabled status flag alone establishes how ignition occurred.','Status nonaktif saja memastikan bagaimana api mulai.'),('A fire-origin area identifies a perpetrator without access evidence.','Area asal api mengidentifikasi pelaku tanpa bukti akses.'),('A warning caller must also have caused the event.','Penelepon peringatan pasti juga menyebabkan kejadian.'),('A serious event justifies ignoring contradictory logs.','Kejadian serius membenarkan pengabaian catatan bertentangan.')],
16:[('A biological match uniquely establishes personal identity and responsibility.','Kecocokan biologis memastikan identitas pribadi serta tanggung jawab secara unik.'),('Face recognition proves a unique individual without considering the case rules.','Pengenalan wajah membuktikan individu unik tanpa mempertimbangkan aturan kasus.'),('Different memories must establish which person is morally superior.','Ingatan berbeda pasti menetapkan siapa yang lebih unggul secara moral.'),('The same genome requires the same later life history.','Genom sama mengharuskan riwayat hidup belakangan sama.'),('An extraordinary possibility removes the need for ordinary chronology.','Kemungkinan luar biasa menghapus kebutuhan kronologi biasa.'),('Matching fingerprints alone prove a person travelled between both sites.','Sidik jari cocok saja membuktikan seseorang berpindah antara dua lokasi.'),('A remembered detail is independent identity verification.','Detail yang diingat adalah verifikasi identitas independen.'),('A project label proves every speculative claim is real-world science.','Label proyek membuktikan semua klaim spekulatif adalah sains dunia nyata.')],
17:[('A photographed administrative detail by itself proves homicide.','Detail administratif dalam foto sendiri membuktikan pembunuhan.'),('A valid executive alibi exonerates every person involved in a financial scheme.','Alibi eksekutif valid membebaskan semua orang dalam skema keuangan.'),('A routine approval establishes knowledge of all downstream conduct.','Persetujuan rutin memastikan pengetahuan semua tindakan lanjutan.'),('A reimbursement date necessarily equals the actual delivery date.','Tanggal penggantian biaya pasti sama dengan tanggal pengiriman nyata.'),('A copied label establishes the physical document’s location.','Label disalin memastikan lokasi dokumen fisik.'),('A shared employer makes all staff knowing conspirators.','Pemberi kerja sama menjadikan semua staf konspirator sadar.'),('Financial motive alone identifies the person responsible for the death.','Motif keuangan saja mengidentifikasi pihak bertanggung jawab atas kematian.'),('An unusual observation is reliable without independent checking.','Pengamatan tak biasa andal tanpa pemeriksaan independen.')],
18:[('Vivid childhood memory independently proves every historical detail.','Ingatan masa kecil jelas secara independen membuktikan semua detail historis.'),('An inconsistent recollection means the witness is intentionally deceptive.','Ingatan tidak konsisten berarti saksi sengaja berbohong.'),('An official runaway classification verifies its own factual basis.','Klasifikasi resmi kabur memverifikasi dasar faktualnya sendiri.'),('A familiar piece of jewelry uniquely identifies its wearer.','Perhiasan yang dikenali mengidentifikasi pemakainya secara unik.'),('Absence of a surviving record proves an event never happened.','Tidak adanya catatan tersisa membuktikan kejadian tidak pernah terjadi.'),('A later family story must be an independent childhood observation.','Cerita keluarga belakangan pasti pengamatan masa kecil independen.'),('Every institutional employee necessarily knew the hidden transfer.','Semua pekerja institusi pasti mengetahui pemindahan tersembunyi.'),('A preserved signature alone establishes the entire chain of responsibility.','Tanda tangan tersimpan saja memastikan seluruh rantai tanggung jawab.')]
})
c=case(13,'The Signal from Nowhere','Sinyal dari Ketiadaan','Radio signals & scientific inference','Sinyal radio & inferensi ilmiah','Blackridge mountain town','Kota pegunungan Blackridge',
'A voice on an abandoned facility’s old channel names residents before they vanish. Engineer Owen Marsh disappears while tracing the timing. Tune the recordings and distinguish signal origin from a story attached to it.',
'Suara pada kanal lama fasilitas terbengkalai menyebut nama warga sebelum mereka hilang. Insinyur Owen Marsh lenyap saat menelusuri waktunya. Bandingkan rekaman dan bedakan asal sinyal dari cerita yang dilekatkan padanya.',
'Town radio room|Frequency desk|Mountain survey|Contractor interviews|Relay reconstruction','Ruang radio kota|Meja frekuensi|Survei gunung|Wawancara kontraktor|Rekonstruksi relai',[
('Owen Marsh','Missing telecommunications engineer','Insinyur telekomunikasi hilang',36,'Owen wrote that the transmission schedule resembled a maintenance roster.','Owen menulis jadwal transmisi menyerupai daftar pemeliharaan.','His recorder preserved two independently timed bearings and an unchanged three-tone background chime.','Perekamnya menyimpan dua arah terukur dengan waktu independen serta bunyi latar tiga nada yang tidak berubah.'),('Dr. Lena Cross','Municipal radio engineer','Insinyur radio kota',41,'A radio channel is not an operator’s identity. Reflection can mislead one bearing.','Kanal radio bukan identitas operator. Pantulan dapat menyesatkan satu arah pengukuran.','Two clear-site bearings converge on the ridge relay, not the rail station heard in the background.','Dua arah dari lokasi jelas bertemu di relai punggung gunung, bukan stasiun kereta yang terdengar di latar.'),('Milo Venn','Current maintenance contractor','Kontraktor pemeliharaan kini',45,'The facility is officially closed. Old experiments are outside my contract.','Fasilitas resmi tutup. Eksperimen lama di luar kontrak saya.','My company retains the relay access key and site transport contract.','Perusahaan saya memegang kunci akses relai serta kontrak transportasi lokasi.'),('Ada Rell','Former research contractor','Mantan kontraktor riset',63,'I heard rumors of unusual communications research. I never operated such an experiment.','Saya mendengar rumor riset komunikasi tak biasa. Saya tidak pernah menjalankan eksperimen semacam itu.','The surviving signed project manual describes atmospheric monitoring and ordinary relay equipment.','Manual proyek bertanda tangan yang tersisa menjelaskan pemantauan atmosfer serta peralatan relai biasa.')],
'Milo Venn used an ordinary scheduled transmitter at the ridge relay to broadcast names from a confidential inspection roster. His company then sent false inspection summons and moved the named surveyors to a secured maintenance building to suppress evidence of unlawful dumping. The fifteen-minute lead reflected a planned sequence, not foreknowledge. Background rail chimes were reused audio: their identical waveform across recordings and bearings away from the station distinguish an audio source from a radio source. Owen traced the relay and was detained after documenting the scheduler. Signed access records, the recovered scheduled playlist, Venn’s transport orders and independent gate footage establish the operation. A current warrant-backed search locates Owen and the surveyors alive at building M-4. Historical project rumors remain unverified and unnecessary to the explanation. The playable radio uses synthetic audio examples, not real radio transmission.',
'Milo Venn memakai pemancar terjadwal biasa di relai punggung gunung untuk menyiarkan nama dari daftar inspeksi rahasia. Perusahaannya lalu mengirim panggilan inspeksi palsu serta memindahkan surveyor bernama itu ke bangunan pemeliharaan terkunci untuk menekan bukti pembuangan ilegal. Jeda lima belas menit mencerminkan urutan direncanakan, bukan pengetahuan masa depan. Bunyi kereta latar adalah audio yang dipakai ulang: bentuk gelombang identik antarrekaman serta arah yang menjauhi stasiun membedakan sumber audio dari sumber radio. Owen menelusuri relai lalu ditahan setelah mendokumentasikan penjadwal. Catatan akses bertanda tangan, daftar putar terjadwal ditemukan, perintah transportasi Venn, serta rekaman gerbang independen memastikan operasi. Pencarian terkini berizin menemukan Owen serta surveyor hidup di bangunan M-4. Rumor proyek historis tetap belum terverifikasi dan tidak diperlukan bagi penjelasan. Radio permainan memakai contoh audio sintetis, bukan transmisi radio nyata.')
vrecords(c,'''Town recording|Rekaman kota|At 18:00 a transmission names surveyor Nia Bell. Her disappearance is reported after a purported site pickup at 18:15. Receiver and dispatch clocks are independently checked.|Pukul 18.00 transmisi menyebut surveyor Nia Bell. Hilangnya dilaporkan setelah penjemputan lokasi yang diklaim pukul 18.15. Jam penerima serta pengiriman diperiksa independen.|The broadcast precedes the pickup, but sequence alone does not establish prediction.|Siaran mendahului penjemputan, tetapi urutan saja tidak memastikan ramalan.
Frequency archive|Arsip frekuensi|The 154.120 MHz channel appears in the facility’s old local relay register. The register identifies equipment allocation, not a current sender.|Kanal 154.120 MHz muncul dalam daftar relai lokal lama fasilitas. Daftar mengidentifikasi alokasi alat, bukan pengirim saat ini.|A historical channel association is a lead rather than operator identification.|Hubungan kanal historis adalah petunjuk, bukan identifikasi operator.
Engineer’s timing chart|Bagan waktu insinyur|Three recorded names are followed five minutes later by inspection summons and fifteen minutes later by contracted pickups. The phase relationship repeats.|Tiga nama terekam diikuti panggilan inspeksi lima menit kemudian serta penjemputan kontrak lima belas menit kemudian. Hubungan jeda berulang.|A recurring schedule offers a testable alternative to supernatural timing.|Jadwal berulang memberi alternatif yang dapat diuji terhadap waktu gaib.
Background audio comparison|Pembandingan audio latar|Every name recording contains the same three-tone rail chime with identical small waveform defects. Live chimes recorded at the station vary in noise and timing.|Setiap rekaman nama memuat bunyi kereta tiga nada dengan cacat gelombang kecil identik. Bunyi langsung di stasiun bervariasi dalam derau serta waktu.|Reused audio explains the apparent distant background without locating the transmitter there.|Audio dipakai ulang menjelaskan latar jauh yang tampak tanpa menempatkan pemancar di sana.
Clear-site direction survey|Survei arah lokasi jelas|Two surveyed, non-reflected bearings intersect at the ridge relay. The railway station is outside their overlap. One earlier valley bearing was reflected.|Dua arah terukur tanpa pantulan berpotongan di relai punggung gunung. Stasiun di luar irisan. Satu arah lembah sebelumnya mengalami pantulan.|Independent clear-site observations constrain the radio origin more strongly than the soundtrack.|Pengamatan independen dari lokasi jelas membatasi asal radio lebih kuat daripada suara latarnya.
Recovered equipment|Peralatan ditemukan|Owen’s abandoned receiver holds the same measured channel and a note: “check ridge relay scheduler.” It contains no evidence of impossible propagation.|Penerima Owen yang ditinggalkan menyimpan kanal terukur sama serta catatan: “periksa penjadwal relai punggung.” Tidak ada bukti perambatan mustahil.|The engineer’s lead concerns inspectable ordinary equipment.|Petunjuk insinyur menyangkut peralatan biasa yang dapat diperiksa.
Project manual|Manual proyek|The signed decommissioning manual describes atmospheric sampling and conventional relay functions. Ada’s extraordinary-project story has no corresponding authenticated document.|Manual penutupan bertanda tangan menjelaskan pengambilan sampel atmosfer serta fungsi relai konvensional. Cerita proyek luar biasa Ada tidak memiliki dokumen terautentikasi yang sesuai.|A documented routine function outweighs an uncorroborated project rumor.|Fungsi rutin terdokumentasi lebih kuat daripada rumor proyek tanpa penguatan.
Relay access journal|Jurnal akses relai|Venn’s individual hardware credential opens the relay before all three broadcasts. An independent access camera identifies him at the cabinet.|Kredensial perangkat individu Venn membuka relai sebelum tiga siaran. Kamera akses independen mengidentifikasinya di lemari.|Credential records and imagery corroborate the current operator’s opportunity.|Catatan kredensial serta gambar menguatkan kesempatan operator saat ini.
Scheduler examination|Pemeriksaan penjadwal|A legally recovered local playlist schedules the names and reused chime before the related summons. Its saved revision is signed by Venn’s credential.|Daftar putar lokal yang diperoleh sah menjadwalkan nama serta bunyi dipakai ulang sebelum panggilan terkait. Revisi tersimpan ditandatangani kredensial Venn.|The recorded lead times were deliberately scheduled in advance.|Jeda waktu terekam sengaja dijadwalkan sebelumnya.
Inspection roster|Daftar inspeksi|All named residents had documented unlawful dumping on Venn’s site contract. Their confidential contact list matches the scheduler order.|Semua warga bernama mendokumentasikan pembuangan ilegal pada kontrak lokasi Venn. Daftar kontak rahasianya sesuai urutan penjadwal.|The selection has a documented shared informational connection.|Pemilihan memiliki hubungan informasi bersama yang terdokumentasi.
Transport orders|Perintah transportasi|Venn’s signed orders route the purported inspection pickups, including Owen’s later trip, to maintenance building M-4. Gate imagery confirms the vehicle arrivals.|Perintah bertanda tangan Venn mengarahkan penjemputan inspeksi yang diklaim, termasuk perjalanan Owen belakangan, ke bangunan M-4. Gambar gerbang memastikan kedatangan kendaraan.|Transport records connect the signal scheme to the disappearances.|Catatan transportasi menghubungkan skema sinyal dengan hilangnya orang.
Current location report|Laporan lokasi terkini|Warrant-backed surveillance confirms Owen and the named surveyors visible inside M-4, with the contracted vehicle outside. Police coordinate recovery.|Pengawasan berizin memastikan Owen serta surveyor bernama terlihat di M-4, dengan kendaraan kontrak di luar. Polisi mengoordinasikan penyelamatan.|A current independently checked location supports recovery rather than speculative pursuit.|Lokasi terkini yang diperiksa independen mendukung penyelamatan, bukan pengejaran spekulatif.''')
vf(c,'What produced the apparent prediction?','Apa yang menghasilkan ramalan yang tampak?','A planned sequence of scheduled names, summons and pickups','Urutan nama terjadwal, panggilan, serta penjemputan yang direncanakan',[('Verified knowledge arriving from the future','Pengetahuan terverifikasi dari masa depan'),('A rail chime causing disappearances','Bunyi kereta menyebabkan orang hilang'),('The old allocation register operating by itself','Daftar alokasi lama bekerja sendiri')],'The scheduler and repeating phases explain the advance timing.','Penjadwal serta jeda berulang menjelaskan waktu lebih awal.')
vf(c,'Who is linked to operation and transport?','Siapa terhubung dengan operasi serta transportasi?','Milo Venn','Milo Venn',[('Ada Rell solely because of her former job','Ada Rell hanya karena pekerjaan lamanya'),('Lena Cross because she measured bearings','Lena Cross karena mengukur arah'),('Owen Marsh because his receiver was found','Owen Marsh karena penerimanya ditemukan')],'Signed scheduling, independently confirmed relay access and transport orders converge.','Penjadwalan bertanda tangan, akses relai terkonfirmasi independen, serta perintah transportasi saling menguatkan.')
vf(c,'Where does the evidence place the transmitter and missing people?','Di mana bukti menempatkan pemancar serta orang hilang?','Transmitter at the ridge relay; people at M-4','Pemancar di relai punggung; orang di M-4',[('Both at the railway because its chime is audible','Keduanya di stasiun karena bunyinya terdengar'),('Both at an unspecified extraterrestrial source','Keduanya di sumber luar bumi yang tak ditentukan'),('The receiver location uniquely identifies both','Lokasi penerima mengidentifikasi keduanya secara unik')],'Direction measurements locate the radio; transport and current surveillance locate the people.','Pengukuran arah menempatkan radio; transportasi serta pengawasan terkini menempatkan orang.')
tool(c,'radio',1,'Radio signal workbench','Meja analisis sinyal radio','Tune four recorded sample channels. Compare timing, background patterns and measured bearings. Audio playback is a synthetic illustration and sends no radio signal.','Pilih empat kanal sampel terekam. Bandingkan waktu, pola latar, serta arah terukur. Pemutaran audio adalah ilustrasi sintetis dan tidak mengirim sinyal radio.',[
('154.100 MHz · reference','154.100 MHz · pembanding','Station reference: a three-tone chime with variable background noise. A familiar sound does not locate a transmitter.','Pembanding stasiun: bunyi tiga nada dengan derau latar bervariasi. Suara dikenal tidak menempatkan pemancar.'),('154.120 MHz · names','154.120 MHz · nama','18:00 named transmission; 18:05 summons; 18:15 pickup. A precisely repeated chime is present in the recorded names.','18.00 transmisi nama; 18.05 panggilan; 18.15 penjemputan. Bunyi berulang persis hadir pada rekaman nama.'),('154.140 MHz · comparison','154.140 MHz · pembandingan','The comparison sample repeats the same three-tone pattern without changing defects, illustrating reused background audio. Compare the recorded waveform as well as listening.','Sampel pembanding mengulang pola tiga nada sama tanpa perubahan cacat, mengilustrasikan audio latar dipakai ulang. Bandingkan bentuk gelombang terekam selain mendengarkan.'),('154.160 MHz · survey','154.160 MHz · survei','The clear-site bearing intersection is the ridge relay. A reflected valley bearing is not an independent origin estimate. The rail soundtrack and radio origin are separate questions.','Irisan arah dari lokasi jelas adalah relai punggung. Arah pantulan lembah bukan perkiraan asal independen. Suara kereta serta asal radio adalah pertanyaan berbeda.')],['E13-04','E13-05'])
c=case(14,'The Victim Who Chose the Next Victim','Korban yang Memilih Korban Berikutnya','Victim networks & historical roles','Jaringan korban & peran historis','Greyhaven Behavioral Analysis Unit','Unit Analisis Perilaku Greyhaven',
'Three former rehabilitation-program participants disappear. Each leaves a handwritten letter naming the next. The sequence looks like revenge, but the surviving records suggest someone is following a chain of documents.',
'Tiga mantan peserta program rehabilitasi hilang. Masing-masing meninggalkan surat tulisan tangan yang menyebut nama berikutnya. Urutan tampak seperti dendam, tetapi arsip tersisa mengisyaratkan rantai dokumen.',
'Letter intake|Program archive|Relationship board|Courier records|Pattern reconstruction','Penerimaan surat|Arsip program|Papan hubungan|Catatan kurir|Rekonstruksi pola',[
('Nora Bell','Missing former intake volunteer','Mantan relawan penerimaan hilang',38,'Nora kept a copy of an intake note from a disputed incident.','Nora menyimpan salinan catatan penerimaan dari insiden disengketakan.','The note identifies the next copy holder, not a list of people she blamed.','Catatan mengidentifikasi pemegang salinan berikutnya, bukan daftar orang yang ia salahkan.'),('Amir Lane','Missing former program driver','Mantan pengemudi program hilang',46,'Amir kept the transfer receipt attached to Nora’s note.','Amir menyimpan kuitansi pemindahan yang terlampir pada catatan Nora.','His receipt points to the night-records duplicate kept by June.','Kuitansinya mengarah pada duplikat catatan malam yang disimpan June.'),('June Mercer','Missing former records trainee','Mantan peserta magang arsip hilang',35,'June retained a duplicate because the official accident account had changed.','June menyimpan duplikat karena laporan kecelakaan resmi berubah.','Her duplicate names the independent auditor who requested the full chain.','Duplikatnya menyebut auditor independen yang meminta rantai lengkap.'),('Marta Keene','Former records officer and current trust manager','Mantan petugas arsip dan manajer yayasan kini',49,'The letters are a former patient’s revenge. Our trust has nothing to hide.','Surat-surat itu balas dendam mantan pasien. Yayasan kami tidak menyembunyikan apa pun.','I authorized the archive-retrieval courier and still hold the legacy role index.','Saya mengizinkan kurir pengambilan arsip serta masih memegang indeks peran lama.'),('Riley Nolen','Former patient named in the old incident','Mantan pasien dalam insiden lama',32,'I was transferred after the incident, not secretly running a revenge campaign.','Saya dipindahkan setelah insiden itu, bukan diam-diam menjalankan pembalasan.','Independent placement records and my verified current whereabouts support that history.','Catatan penempatan independen serta keberadaan saya saat ini yang terverifikasi mendukung riwayat itu.'),('Dara Finch','Surviving recipient and external auditor','Penerima selamat dan auditor eksternal',42,'The letter named me after I requested the last duplicate.','Surat menyebut saya setelah saya meminta duplikat terakhir.','The pattern tracks where the original documents went, not how close we were to Riley.','Pola mengikuti ke mana dokumen asli berpindah, bukan kedekatan kami dengan Riley.')],
'Marta Keene coerced document holders to surrender their copies and write letters naming the next holder, creating a misleading victim-selected sequence. Nora’s intake copy led to Amir’s transfer receipt, then June’s night-records duplicate, then Dara’s audit request. Their order follows document custody rather than severity of grievance or a psychological profile. The original incident involved an injury and a questionable transfer later concealed as an accident; Riley’s independently verified relocation defeats the missing-avenger assumption. Marta’s exclusive legacy role index, signed courier orders, authenticated coercive instructions and independent footage of the pickups establish her orchestration. A current police search finds the three document holders alive at the contracted retrieval depot. Their histories as rehabilitation participants do not imply dangerousness or culpability. The scheme’s objective was suppressing the documentary trail before the independent audit exposed the trust’s historical concealment.',
'Marta Keene memaksa pemegang dokumen menyerahkan salinan serta menulis surat yang menyebut pemegang berikutnya, menciptakan urutan menyesatkan seolah dipilih korban. Salinan penerimaan Nora mengarah pada kuitansi pemindahan Amir, lalu duplikat catatan malam June, kemudian permintaan audit Dara. Urutan mengikuti penguasaan dokumen, bukan beratnya keluhan atau profil psikologis. Insiden asli melibatkan cedera serta pemindahan meragukan yang kemudian disembunyikan sebagai kecelakaan; relokasi Riley yang diverifikasi independen membantah anggapan pembalas yang hilang. Indeks peran lama eksklusif Marta, perintah kurir bertanda tangan, instruksi paksaan terautentikasi, serta rekaman penjemputan independen memastikan perancangannya. Pencarian polisi terkini menemukan tiga pemegang dokumen hidup di depo pengambilan kontrak. Riwayat mereka sebagai peserta rehabilitasi tidak menyiratkan bahaya atau kesalahan. Tujuan skema adalah menekan jejak dokumen sebelum audit independen mengungkap penyembunyian historis yayasan.')
vrecords(c,'''Letter sequence|Urutan surat|Nora’s letter names Amir; Amir’s names June; June’s names Dara. Each was found after the earlier recipient’s disappearance.|Surat Nora menyebut Amir; surat Amir menyebut June; surat June menyebut Dara. Masing-masing ditemukan setelah penerima sebelumnya hilang.|The observed naming sequence does not by itself identify who selected it.|Urutan penamaan teramati tidak dengan sendirinya mengidentifikasi pemilihnya.
Handwriting examination|Pemeriksaan tulisan tangan|The letters are consistent with their respective recipients’ writing, but the examiner cannot determine whether they wrote freely or under coercion.|Surat sesuai tulisan masing-masing penerima, tetapi pemeriksa tidak dapat menentukan apakah mereka menulis bebas atau dipaksa.|Authorship evidence does not establish voluntary target selection.|Bukti kepenulisan tidak memastikan pemilihan target sukarela.
Victim role profiles|Profil peran korban|Nora handled intake copies, Amir transfer receipts, June night-record duplicates. Dara was an outside auditor, not a program participant.|Nora menangani salinan penerimaan, Amir kuitansi pemindahan, June duplikat catatan malam. Dara auditor luar, bukan peserta program.|Different administrative roles may explain the connection better than a shared patient history.|Peran administratif berbeda mungkin menjelaskan hubungan lebih baik daripada riwayat pasien bersama.
Intake note duplicate|Duplikat catatan penerimaan|Nora’s retained note refers to an injury and attaches receipt T-8 held by Amir. It does not rank personal grievances.|Catatan tersimpan Nora merujuk cedera serta melampirkan kuitansi T-8 yang dipegang Amir. Tidak ada peringkat keluhan pribadi.|The first documentary link points to the next record holder.|Hubungan dokumen pertama mengarah pada pemegang catatan berikutnya.
Transfer receipt T-8|Kuitansi pemindahan T-8|Amir’s independently retained receipt names the night-record file duplicated by June. Its time conflicts with the later accident summary.|Kuitansi Amir yang disimpan independen menyebut berkas malam yang diduplikasi June. Waktunya bertentangan dengan ringkasan kecelakaan belakangan.|The second link continues a custody trail and challenges the official summary.|Hubungan kedua melanjutkan jejak penguasaan serta menantang ringkasan resmi.
Night-record duplicate|Duplikat catatan malam|June’s copy records the disputed transfer and Dara’s recent request for certified originals. The next named person is the requester.|Salinan June mencatat pemindahan disengketakan serta permintaan baru Dara atas dokumen asli tersertifikasi. Orang bernama berikutnya adalah peminta.|The final link follows the audit request rather than an old personal grudge.|Hubungan terakhir mengikuti permintaan audit, bukan dendam pribadi lama.
Riley placement verification|Verifikasi penempatan Riley|Independent placement and current identity records show Riley was relocated after the incident. Verified travel and work records exclude the pickup windows.|Catatan penempatan serta identitas terkini independen menunjukkan Riley direlokasi setelah insiden. Catatan perjalanan serta kerja terverifikasi menyingkirkan rentang penjemputan.|The rumored avenger hypothesis conflicts with independently verified history and opportunity.|Hipotesis pembalas yang dirumorkan bertentangan dengan riwayat serta kesempatan terverifikasi independen.
Legacy role index|Indeks peran lama|Marta retained the confidential index linking the three holders and the outside request. No public alumni directory contains those custody relationships.|Marta menyimpan indeks rahasia yang menghubungkan tiga pemegang serta permintaan luar. Tidak ada direktori alumni publik memuat hubungan penguasaan itu.|Access to the nonpublic custody map narrows the knowledge required for the scheme.|Akses peta penguasaan nonpublik mempersempit pengetahuan yang diperlukan bagi skema.
Courier authorizations|Izin kurir|Marta’s hardware-signed retrieval orders schedule visits to Nora, Amir and June in the letter sequence. Independent camera records confirm each pickup.|Perintah pengambilan bertanda tangan perangkat Marta menjadwalkan kunjungan Nora, Amir, June sesuai urutan surat. Rekaman kamera independen memastikan tiap penjemputan.|Authenticated instructions and physical observations connect the organizer to the sequence.|Instruksi terautentikasi serta pengamatan fisik menghubungkan pengatur dengan urutan.
Recovered instructions|Instruksi ditemukan|A legally obtained contractor message from Marta orders the holders kept until they identify the next copy and handwrite a forwarding note. Its signature is authenticated.|Pesan kontraktor dari Marta yang diperoleh sah memerintahkan pemegang ditahan sampai mengidentifikasi salinan berikutnya serta menulis catatan penerusan. Tanda tangannya terautentikasi.|Coercion explains why genuine handwriting need not mean voluntary selection.|Paksaan menjelaskan mengapa tulisan asli tidak harus berarti pemilihan sukarela.
Trust audit correspondence|Korespondensi audit yayasan|The trust faces review of the altered accident record and related historical payments. Marta asks that the original chain be retrieved before Dara’s hearing.|Yayasan menghadapi tinjauan catatan kecelakaan diubah serta pembayaran historis terkait. Marta meminta rantai asli diambil sebelum sidang Dara.|Suppressing corroborating records supplies a documented objective distinct from revenge.|Menekan catatan penguat memberi tujuan terdokumentasi yang berbeda dari dendam.
Depot location check|Pemeriksaan lokasi depo|A current warrant-backed observation identifies the three missing adults at the retrieval depot linked to the courier contract. Police coordinate their release.|Pengamatan terkini berizin mengidentifikasi tiga orang dewasa hilang di depo pengambilan terkait kontrak kurir. Polisi mengoordinasikan pembebasannya.|The documentary chain leads to a corroborated recovery location.|Rantai dokumen mengarah pada lokasi penyelamatan yang dikuatkan.''')
vf(c,'What determines the order of the targets?','Apa yang menentukan urutan target?','Custody of linked originals and the next request in the documentary chain','Penguasaan dokumen asli terkait serta permintaan berikutnya dalam rantai dokumen',[('Severity of a former patient’s grievances','Beratnya keluhan mantan pasien'),('Random neighborhood proximity','Kedekatan lingkungan acak'),('The victims’ independent desire to select a successor','Keinginan independen korban memilih penerus')],'Intake, transfer, night-record and audit-request links reproduce the naming sequence.','Hubungan penerimaan, pemindahan, catatan malam, serta permintaan audit mereproduksi urutan nama.')
vf(c,'Who is supported as the organizer?','Siapa yang didukung sebagai pengatur?','Marta Keene','Marta Keene',[('Riley Nolen because of the old rumor','Riley Nolen karena rumor lama'),('Dara Finch because she survived','Dara Finch karena selamat'),('Nora Bell solely because she wrote a letter','Nora Bell hanya karena menulis surat')],'Private index access, signed orders and coercive instructions converge on Marta.','Akses indeks pribadi, perintah bertanda tangan, serta instruksi paksaan mengarah pada Marta.')
vf(c,'Why were the letters in the victims’ handwriting?','Mengapa surat memakai tulisan tangan korban?','They were compelled to identify the next document holder','Mereka dipaksa mengidentifikasi pemegang dokumen berikutnya',[('Handwriting proves a free choice of victim','Tulisan tangan membuktikan pilihan korban yang bebas'),('A psychological diagnosis reproduces handwriting','Diagnosis psikologis mereproduksi tulisan'),('The letters establish Riley’s location','Surat memastikan lokasi Riley')],'The authenticated instruction explains authorship without assuming voluntary complicity.','Instruksi terautentikasi menjelaskan kepenulisan tanpa menganggap keterlibatan sukarela.')
tool(c,'network',2,'Victim and record connection board','Papan hubungan korban serta catatan','Match the people to the record they held. Compare the documentary route against the proposed revenge route.','Cocokkan orang dengan catatan yang dipegang. Bandingkan rute dokumen dengan dugaan rute dendam.',[
('Nora · intake','Nora · penerimaan','Nora’s intake duplicate cites Amir’s transfer receipt T-8. The connection is a document reference.','Duplikat penerimaan Nora mengutip kuitansi pemindahan T-8 milik Amir. Hubungannya berupa rujukan dokumen.'),('Amir · transfer','Amir · pemindahan','Receipt T-8 identifies June’s night-record duplicate. Its time challenges the later accident summary.','Kuitansi T-8 mengidentifikasi duplikat catatan malam June. Waktunya menantang ringkasan kecelakaan belakangan.'),('June · duplicate','June · duplikat','June’s record includes Dara’s request for originals. Dara’s position in the pattern follows a recent audit, not program participation.','Catatan June memuat permintaan dokumen asli Dara. Posisi Dara dalam pola mengikuti audit baru, bukan keikutsertaan program.'),('Compare hypotheses','Bandingkan hipotesis','The chain fits holder, cited holder, duplicate holder, requester. A grievance ranking does not reproduce this order. This generates a hypothesis that still requires access and conduct evidence.','Rantai sesuai pemegang, pemegang dirujuk, pemegang duplikat, peminta. Peringkat keluhan tidak mereproduksi urutan ini. Ini menghasilkan hipotesis yang tetap memerlukan bukti akses serta tindakan.')],['E14-04','E14-05','E14-06'])
c=case(15,'The Call That Came Too Early','Panggilan yang Datang Terlalu Awal','Emergency chronology & systems reasoning','Kronologi darurat & penalaran sistem','Harbor Emergency Dispatch and Aster Tower','Pusat Darurat Harbor dan Menara Aster',
'At 19:00 a caller describes a fire on floor 23. Responders find no fire there. At 19:20 a serious emergency begins in that location. Was the first call a warning, a distraction, or a description copied from a plan?',
'Pukul 19.00 penelepon menjelaskan kebakaran lantai 23. Petugas tidak menemukan api di sana. Pukul 19.20 keadaan darurat serius dimulai di lokasi itu. Apakah panggilan pertama peringatan, pengalihan, atau deskripsi dari sebuah rencana?',
'Dispatch review|Building schematic|Responder records|Maintenance archive|Origin examination|System interviews|Emergency reconstruction','Tinjauan pengiriman|Skema gedung|Catatan petugas|Arsip pemeliharaan|Pemeriksaan asal|Wawancara sistem|Rekonstruksi darurat',[
('Rina Cole','Emergency dispatcher','Petugas pusat darurat',34,'I treated the reported emergency as real and dispatched responders.','Saya memperlakukan laporan darurat sebagai nyata serta mengirim petugas.','The recording preserves the first call at 19:00; all later times must be checked against independent systems.','Rekaman menyimpan panggilan pertama pukul 19.00; semua waktu belakangan perlu dibandingkan dengan sistem independen.'),('Captain Ezra Shaw','Fire response commander','Komandan respons kebakaran',45,'At 19:06 floor 23 showed no active fire. That finding described that moment, not the building’s future.','Pukul 19.06 lantai 23 tidak menunjukkan api aktif. Temuan itu menjelaskan saat itu, bukan masa depan gedung.','A later alarm required a fresh operational response; investigators reviewed the causes afterward.','Alarm belakangan memerlukan respons operasional baru; penyidik meninjau sebab sesudahnya.'),('Mara Linn','Building safety technician and caller','Teknisi keselamatan serta penelepon',31,'I used a temporary device because my safety reports had been suppressed. I should have described it as a warning.','Saya memakai perangkat sementara karena laporan keselamatan ditekan. Seharusnya saya menyebutnya peringatan.','The details came from the exercise script and occupancy sheet, not from seeing a future event.','Detail berasal dari naskah latihan serta lembar penghuni, bukan melihat kejadian masa depan.'),('Colin Serle','Maintenance operations manager','Manajer operasi pemeliharaan',48,'The approved inspection had already cleared the building.','Inspeksi yang disetujui sudah menyatakan gedung aman.','I authorized a later live maintenance test; its conditions differed from the inspected plan.','Saya mengizinkan uji pemeliharaan langsung belakangan; kondisinya berbeda dari rencana yang diinspeksi.'),('Dr. Alia Penn','Independent fire investigator','Penyidik kebakaran independen',43,'Origin findings constrain a mechanism; they do not read a person’s intent.','Temuan asal membatasi mekanisme; tidak membaca niat seseorang.','The physical examination and synchronized equipment records need to support the same sequence.','Pemeriksaan fisik serta catatan alat tersinkron perlu mendukung urutan yang sama.')],
'Mara Linn’s 19:00 call was an improperly framed warning based on a copied exercise script, a resident-assistance sheet and knowledge of a later unauthorized maintenance test. It was not supernatural prediction and did not itself cause the fire. Responders correctly found no active fire on floor 23 at 19:06; the later 19:20 alarm concerned a new event. Colin Serle had authorized a live test involving equipment already flagged as defective while the relevant suppression system remained in an unauthorized maintenance state. Independent origin examination and synchronized equipment logs support that unsafe test as the ignition-related event and the unavailable suppression as a contributing failure; they do not prove he intended a fire or predict its precise spread. The minor electrical fault on floor 20 was a separate documented event. Serle’s signed orders and rejected stop-work notices establish responsibility for the unsafe conditions. The caller’s identity is corroborated through records and her disclosure, not inferred merely from an unregistered device. Fire and emergency procedures in this fictional case require specialist review; the game is an untimed retrospective investigation, not operational emergency advice.',
'Panggilan Mara Linn pukul 19.00 adalah peringatan yang dibingkai keliru berdasarkan salinan naskah latihan, lembar bantuan penghuni, serta pengetahuan uji pemeliharaan tanpa izin belakangan. Itu bukan ramalan gaib dan tidak dengan sendirinya menyebabkan kebakaran. Petugas benar tidak menemukan api aktif di lantai 23 pukul 19.06; alarm 19.20 menyangkut kejadian baru. Colin Serle mengizinkan uji langsung melibatkan alat yang sudah ditandai rusak sementara sistem pemadaman terkait tetap dalam status pemeliharaan tanpa izin. Pemeriksaan asal independen serta catatan alat tersinkron mendukung uji tak aman itu sebagai kejadian terkait penyalaan dan pemadaman tak tersedia sebagai kegagalan penyumbang; temuan itu tidak membuktikan ia menghendaki kebakaran atau meramalkan penyebaran tepatnya. Gangguan listrik kecil lantai 20 adalah kejadian terdokumentasi terpisah. Perintah bertanda tangan Serle serta penolakan pemberitahuan penghentian kerja menetapkan tanggung jawab atas kondisi tidak aman. Identitas penelepon dikuatkan catatan serta pengakuannya, bukan semata disimpulkan dari perangkat tak terdaftar. Prosedur kebakaran serta darurat dalam kasus fiksi ini memerlukan tinjauan spesialis; permainan adalah investigasi retrospektif tanpa batas waktu, bukan saran operasional darurat.')
vrecords(c,'''Emergency call record|Catatan panggilan darurat|At verified dispatch time 19:00 the caller names floor 23 and residents needing assistance. The caller describes a current fire but gives no direct visual proof.|Pada waktu pusat darurat terverifikasi 19.00 penelepon menyebut lantai 23 serta penghuni perlu bantuan. Penelepon menjelaskan kebakaran kini tetapi tidak memberi bukti visual langsung.|The call establishes a report and its time, not the physical existence of a fire then.|Panggilan memastikan laporan serta waktunya, bukan keberadaan fisik api saat itu.
Initial responder report|Laporan petugas awal|At 19:06 responders inspect floor 23 and find no active fire or smoke there. Their continuous record separately notes a minor fault on floor 20.|Pukul 19.06 petugas memeriksa lantai 23 dan tidak menemukan api atau asap aktif. Catatan tanpa jeda secara terpisah mencatat gangguan kecil lantai 20.|The initial observation is compatible with a later new emergency.|Pengamatan awal sesuai dengan keadaan darurat baru belakangan.
Synchronized alarm log|Catatan alarm tersinkron|The floor-23 alarm first activates at 19:20. A reference-clock audit confirms its order relative to the 19:00 call and 19:06 inspection.|Alarm lantai 23 pertama aktif 19.20. Audit jam acuan memastikan urutannya terhadap panggilan 19.00 serta inspeksi 19.06.|Independent clocks establish a twenty-minute lead for the report.|Jam independen memastikan laporan dua puluh menit lebih awal.
Building assistance plan|Rencana bantuan gedung|The internal occupancy sheet lists the same residents and assistance locations described in the first call. Access was restricted to safety and maintenance staff.|Lembar penghuni internal memuat warga serta lokasi bantuan sama seperti panggilan pertama. Akses terbatas pada staf keselamatan serta pemeliharaan.|Administrative knowledge can supply details that sound like direct observation.|Pengetahuan administratif dapat memberi detail yang terdengar seperti pengamatan langsung.
Exercise script archive|Arsip naskah latihan|A planned floor-23 scenario includes the caller’s unusual wording about smoke and trapped occupants. It was written before the incident and marked as an exercise.|Skenario lantai 23 yang direncanakan memuat kata-kata tak biasa penelepon tentang asap serta penghuni terjebak. Naskah ditulis sebelum insiden dan ditandai latihan.|An earlier script provides a testable source for apparently predictive phrasing.|Naskah lebih awal memberi sumber yang dapat diuji bagi kata-kata yang tampak meramal.
Dispatch and movement timeline|Linimasa pengiriman serta gerak|19:00 call; 19:06 floor inspection; 19:14 maintenance entry; 19:20 alarm; renewed responder action follows. The records distinguish initial inquiry from the later response.|19.00 panggilan; 19.06 inspeksi lantai; 19.14 masuk pemeliharaan; 19.20 alarm; tindakan petugas baru mengikuti. Catatan membedakan pemeriksaan awal dari respons belakangan.|Responder movement should be reconstructed as separate time-linked events.|Pergerakan petugas perlu direkonstruksi sebagai kejadian terpisah terkait waktu.
Inspection version record|Catatan versi inspeksi|The earlier signed safety inspection covered a non-live plan with suppression available. The subsequent work order changed those conditions.|Inspeksi keselamatan bertanda tangan lama mencakup rencana tidak langsung dengan pemadaman tersedia. Perintah kerja berikutnya mengubah kondisi itu.|Approval of an earlier configuration does not validate a changed live test.|Persetujuan konfigurasi lama tidak memvalidasi uji langsung yang diubah.
Maintenance authorization|Izin pemeliharaan|Serle’s authenticated order authorizes a live test of equipment with an unresolved defect notice. The stop-work warning is attached and acknowledged.|Perintah terautentikasi Serle mengizinkan uji langsung alat dengan pemberitahuan kerusakan belum selesai. Peringatan penghentian kerja terlampir serta diakui.|Documented authorization links the manager to the known unsafe condition.|Izin terdokumentasi menghubungkan manajer dengan kondisi tidak aman yang diketahui.
Suppression status audit|Audit status pemadaman|At the later event the relevant suppression system remains in a maintenance state not covered by the earlier approval. Independent logs and physical examination agree.|Saat kejadian belakangan sistem pemadaman terkait tetap berstatus pemeliharaan yang tidak dicakup persetujuan lama. Catatan independen serta pemeriksaan fisik sesuai.|A contributing system failure is documented separately from ignition.|Kegagalan sistem penyumbang terdokumentasi terpisah dari penyalaan.
Equipment event record|Catatan kejadian alat|The authorized live test begins shortly before the first floor-23 alarm. Independent equipment and access records agree on the sequence.|Uji langsung yang diizinkan dimulai sesaat sebelum alarm pertama lantai 23. Catatan alat serta akses independen sesuai urutannya.|The test is a causally relevant event requiring physical origin corroboration.|Uji adalah kejadian relevan sebab yang memerlukan penguatan fisik asal.
Origin examination|Pemeriksaan asal|The independent examiner locates the origin in the affected equipment area and finds evidence consistent with the logged defect-related event. No exact spread timetable or intention is inferred.|Pemeriksa independen menempatkan asal pada area alat terdampak serta menemukan bukti sesuai kejadian terkait kerusakan tercatat. Tidak disimpulkan jadwal penyebaran tepat atau niat.|Physical origin findings corroborate the mechanism without independently identifying intent.|Temuan fisik asal menguatkan mekanisme tanpa mengidentifikasi niat secara mandiri.
Floor-20 fault review|Tinjauan gangguan lantai 20|The initial minor fault is isolated to floor 20. Independent circuit and scene records do not connect it to the later floor-23 origin.|Gangguan kecil awal terbatas di lantai 20. Catatan sirkuit serta lokasi independen tidak menghubungkannya dengan asal lantai 23 belakangan.|A nearby electrical event is not automatically the cause of the later fire.|Kejadian listrik di dekatnya tidak otomatis menjadi sebab kebakaran belakangan.
Caller source disclosure|Pengungkapan sumber penelepon|Mara provides the script copy, earlier safety reports and her temporary-device record. Independent access records confirm she could read the plan but did not authorize the test.|Mara memberi salinan naskah, laporan keselamatan lama, serta catatan perangkat sementara. Catatan akses independen memastikan ia bisa membaca rencana tetapi tidak mengizinkan uji.|The caller’s knowledge source and the maintenance authorization are distinct evidentiary questions.|Sumber pengetahuan penelepon serta izin pemeliharaan adalah pertanyaan bukti berbeda.
Suppressed warning correspondence|Korespondensi peringatan ditekan|Before the incident Serle acknowledges Mara’s defect warning but instructs the team to continue the changed work order. The communication is independently archived.|Sebelum insiden Serle mengakui peringatan kerusakan Mara tetapi memerintah tim melanjutkan perintah kerja berubah. Komunikasi diarsipkan independen.|The record supports knowing disregard of a warning rather than an innocent absence of notice.|Catatan mendukung pengabaian sadar atas peringatan, bukan tidak mengetahui pemberitahuan.
Resident interview reconciliation|Rekonsiliasi wawancara penghuni|Residents confirm the assistance-sheet locations were accurate before the fire. Their later experiences do not establish that the first caller saw smoke at 19:00.|Penghuni memastikan lokasi lembar bantuan akurat sebelum kebakaran. Pengalaman belakangan tidak memastikan penelepon pertama melihat asap pukul 19.00.|Later agreement does not retroactively turn prior administrative knowledge into observation.|Kesesuaian belakangan tidak secara retroaktif mengubah pengetahuan administratif menjadi pengamatan.
Independent causal review|Tinjauan sebab independen|The combined record separates early warning, initial no-fire observation, changed live test, later ignition-related event and unavailable suppression. Responsibility follows authenticated work decisions, not prediction claims.|Catatan gabungan memisahkan peringatan awal, pengamatan tanpa api, uji langsung berubah, kejadian terkait penyalaan belakangan, serta pemadaman tak tersedia. Tanggung jawab mengikuti keputusan kerja terautentikasi, bukan klaim ramalan.|A systems explanation can account for advance knowledge and the later emergency without conflating them.|Penjelasan sistem dapat menjelaskan pengetahuan awal serta darurat belakangan tanpa menyamakannya.''')
vf(c,'How did the caller know the apparent future details?','Bagaimana penelepon mengetahui detail yang tampak dari masa depan?','Through the exercise script, occupancy sheet and advance knowledge of unsafe work','Melalui naskah latihan, lembar penghuni, serta pengetahuan awal pekerjaan tidak aman',[('By observing an already active floor-23 fire at 19:00','Dengan melihat kebakaran lantai 23 aktif pada 19.00'),('Because every alarm clock was wrong','Karena semua jam alarm keliru'),('Through independently proven foreknowledge','Melalui pengetahuan masa depan terbukti independen')],'The archived plan and verified access explain the detailed warning.','Rencana arsip serta akses terverifikasi menjelaskan peringatan terperinci.')
vf(c,'Who authorized the unsafe conditions linked to the later event?','Siapa mengizinkan kondisi tidak aman yang terkait kejadian belakangan?','Colin Serle','Colin Serle',[('Rina Cole because she dispatched responders','Rina Cole karena mengirim petugas'),('Ezra Shaw because he found no initial fire','Ezra Shaw karena tidak menemukan api awal'),('Mara Linn solely because she called','Mara Linn hanya karena menelepon')],'Signed work changes and acknowledged defect warnings attribute the decision to Serle.','Perubahan kerja bertanda tangan serta peringatan diakui mengaitkan keputusan dengan Serle.')
vf(c,'Which sequence fits the independent records?','Urutan mana sesuai catatan independen?','Report, no-fire inspection, changed live test, later alarm','Laporan, inspeksi tanpa api, uji langsung berubah, alarm belakangan',[('Fire already confirmed before the first report','Api sudah terkonfirmasi sebelum laporan pertama'),('The later alarm preceded the call','Alarm belakangan mendahului panggilan'),('The initial floor-20 fault alone explains every record','Gangguan lantai 20 awal saja menjelaskan semua catatan')],'The synchronized chronology distinguishes separate incidents and responses.','Kronologi tersinkron membedakan insiden serta respons terpisah.')
vf(c,'What remains unproven by the origin findings?','Apa yang belum dibuktikan temuan asal?','That Serle intended to start a fire or predicted its exact spread','Bahwa Serle bermaksud menyalakan api atau meramalkan penyebarannya secara tepat',[('The physical origin area','Area fisik asal'),('The acknowledged defect warning','Peringatan kerusakan diakui'),('The order of the call and later alarm','Urutan panggilan serta alarm belakangan')],'Mechanism and unsafe authorization do not by themselves establish deliberate fire-setting intent.','Mekanisme serta izin tak aman tidak dengan sendirinya memastikan niat sengaja membakar.')
tool(c,'dispatch',2,'Dispatch and building reconstruction','Rekonstruksi pusat darurat serta gedung','Review the emergency retrospectively. The four views join independent clocks, a building schematic and responder records; there is no countdown or operational instruction.','Tinjau darurat secara retrospektif. Empat tampilan menggabungkan jam independen, skema gedung, serta catatan petugas; tanpa hitung mundur atau instruksi operasional.',[
('19:00 · call','19.00 · panggilan','A reported floor-23 emergency prompts dispatch. The call is evidence of a report, not physical proof of smoke.','Laporan darurat lantai 23 memicu pengiriman. Panggilan adalah bukti laporan, bukan bukti fisik asap.'),('19:06 · inspection','19.06 · inspeksi','Responders document no active fire on floor 23 and a separate minor floor-20 fault. Their observation is time-specific.','Petugas mendokumentasikan tidak ada api aktif lantai 23 serta gangguan kecil lantai 20 terpisah. Pengamatan terkait waktu tertentu.'),('19:14 · work entry','19.14 · masuk kerja','Access logs place maintenance at the later affected area after the initial inspection. Compare the changed work order with its earlier approved configuration.','Catatan akses menempatkan pemeliharaan pada area terdampak setelah inspeksi awal. Bandingkan perintah kerja berubah dengan konfigurasi lama disetujui.'),('19:20 · new alarm','19.20 · alarm baru','The floor-23 alarm begins as a new event. A renewed responder action follows. The schematic separates floor 20 from floor 23; shared location labels do not prove shared causes.','Alarm lantai 23 dimulai sebagai kejadian baru. Tindakan petugas baru mengikuti. Skema memisahkan lantai 20 dari 23; label lokasi bersama tidak membuktikan sebab bersama.')],['E15-04','E15-05','E15-06'])
c=case(16,'The Other Me','Diriku yang Lain','Personal identity & speculative science','Identitas pribadi & sains spekulatif','Palisade Research Laboratory','Laboratorium Riset Palisade',
'Dr. Elias Voss appears in sabotage footage while independent cameras place him at a distant conference. Biological comparisons match. A twenty-year-old fictional experiment may explain the match without explaining who acted.',
'Dr. Elias Voss muncul dalam rekaman sabotase sementara kamera independen menempatkannya di konferensi jauh. Pembandingan biologis cocok. Eksperimen fiksi dua puluh tahun lalu mungkin menjelaskan kecocokan tanpa menjelaskan siapa bertindak.',
'Identity intake|Conference verification|Palisade archive|Dual-identity desk|Memory interviews|Sabotage reconstruction|Responsibility review','Penerimaan identitas|Verifikasi konferensi|Arsip Palisade|Meja identitas ganda|Wawancara memori|Rekonstruksi sabotase|Tinjauan tanggung jawab',[
('Dr. Elias Voss','Molecular physicist and conference speaker','Fisikawan molekuler serta pembicara konferensi',42,'I was speaking at the conference when the laboratory was attacked.','Saya berbicara di konferensi saat laboratorium diserang.','My adult scar history differs from the man in the laboratory footage.','Riwayat bekas luka dewasa saya berbeda dari pria pada rekaman laboratorium.'),('Silas Voss','Second individual designated D2','Individu kedua berstatus D2',42,'I share his beginning, not the life he lived afterward.','Saya berbagi awal dengannya, bukan kehidupan yang ia jalani sesudahnya.','The old project assigned me D2 and kept my later records separate.','Proyek lama memberi saya D2 serta memisahkan catatan belakangan saya.'),('Dr. Mira Sol','Palisade project director','Direktur proyek Palisade',61,'The public archive describes D2 as a failed simulation.','Arsip publik menyebut D2 sebagai simulasi gagal.','The sealed original protocol and continuing subject records contradict that description.','Protokol asli tersegel serta catatan subjek berkelanjutan bertentangan dengan deskripsi itu.'),('Dr. Tarek Linn','Independent identity examiner','Pemeriksa identitas independen',46,'A biological match must be interpreted under the explicitly fictional project rules.','Kecocokan biologis perlu ditafsirkan menurut aturan proyek yang secara eksplisit fiksi.','Acquired marks and continuously documented movements can distinguish individuals the project copied.','Tanda didapat kemudian serta perpindahan terdokumentasi berkelanjutan dapat membedakan individu yang disalin proyek.'),('Eva Rook','Laboratory security officer','Petugas keamanan laboratorium',35,'The attacker used D2 access and injured a guard during equipment destruction.','Penyerang memakai akses D2 serta melukai penjaga saat merusak peralatan.','Continuous entrance footage shows the acquired left-arm mark, the D2 token and the same clothing through departure.','Rekaman masuk tanpa jeda menunjukkan tanda lengan kiri yang didapat kemudian, token D2, serta pakaian sama sampai keberangkatan.')],
'Under this story’s explicitly fictional Palisade rules, a single adult biological copy was created twenty years ago when Elias was 22. It reproduced the baseline genome, fingerprints and then-existing memories; it cannot teleport, synchronize later experiences or recreate new copies. Elias and the person later named Silas then lived separate lives. Their matched biology therefore does not establish which individual acted. Independently timed conference footage continuously places Elias hundreds of kilometres away during the sabotage. Silas’s separately documented acquired left-arm injury, D2 custody record and continuous laboratory footage link him to the physical act; recovered clothing with scene-specific material corroborates that sequence. His authenticated message states an intention to destroy the project’s control hardware after learning the director planned further coercive testing. That motive explains but does not excuse the sabotage or injury. Mira’s continuing D2 records and false public “simulation” report establish institutional concealment distinct from the attacker’s conduct. No conclusion depends on which person has a more convincing personality or greater claim to being the “real” person. These rules are narrative inventions, not claims that real biological duplication reproduces fingerprints or personal identity.',
'Menurut aturan Palisade yang secara eksplisit fiksi, satu salinan biologis dewasa dibuat dua puluh tahun lalu ketika Elias berusia 22. Salinan mereproduksi genom dasar, sidik jari, serta ingatan saat itu; tidak dapat berteleportasi, menyinkronkan pengalaman belakangan, atau membuat salinan baru. Elias serta orang yang kemudian bernama Silas menjalani kehidupan terpisah. Karena itu kecocokan biologis tidak memastikan individu yang bertindak. Rekaman konferensi dengan waktu independen terus menempatkan Elias ratusan kilometer jauhnya saat sabotase. Cedera lengan kiri Silas yang diperoleh kemudian dan terdokumentasi terpisah, catatan penguasaan D2, serta rekaman laboratorium tanpa jeda menghubungkannya dengan tindakan fisik; pakaian ditemukan dengan material spesifik lokasi menguatkan urutan. Pesan terautentikasinya menyatakan niat merusak perangkat kontrol proyek setelah mengetahui rencana pengujian paksaan lanjutan direktur. Motif itu menjelaskan tetapi tidak membenarkan sabotase atau cedera. Catatan D2 Mira yang berlanjut serta laporan publik “simulasi” palsu memastikan penyembunyian institusional yang terpisah dari tindakan penyerang. Kesimpulan tidak bergantung pada kepribadian lebih meyakinkan atau klaim lebih besar sebagai orang “asli”. Aturan ini ciptaan naratif, bukan klaim bahwa duplikasi biologis nyata mereproduksi sidik jari atau identitas pribadi.')
vrecords(c,'''Initial match bundle|Berkas kecocokan awal|DNA, fingerprint and facial comparisons match the reference labelled Elias. The examiner warns that comparison establishes similarity to a reference, not unique personal attribution under every possible case model.|Pembandingan DNA, sidik jari, serta wajah cocok dengan referensi berlabel Elias. Pemeriksa memperingatkan pembandingan memastikan kesamaan dengan referensi, bukan atribusi pribadi unik dalam semua model kasus.|The match requires interpretation alongside the competing identity hypotheses.|Kecocokan memerlukan tafsir bersama hipotesis identitas yang bersaing.
Conference live record|Rekaman langsung konferensi|Independent organizers preserve continuous multi-camera footage of Elias speaking during the verified sabotage interval. Audience and venue records corroborate his presence.|Penyelenggara independen menyimpan rekaman multikamera berkelanjutan Elias berbicara selama rentang sabotase terverifikasi. Catatan penonton serta tempat menguatkan kehadirannya.|The distant conference presence has independent corroboration.|Kehadiran konferensi jauh memiliki penguatan independen.
Travel-time reconciliation|Rekonsiliasi waktu perjalanan|The conference is hundreds of kilometres from the laboratory. Verified clocks and travel records leave no journey window between the simultaneous observations.|Konferensi berjarak ratusan kilometer dari laboratorium. Jam terverifikasi serta catatan perjalanan tidak memberi rentang perjalanan antara pengamatan bersamaan.|Ordinary travel cannot reconcile the two recorded presences as one continuous person.|Perjalanan biasa tidak menyelaraskan dua kehadiran terekam sebagai satu orang berkelanjutan.
Palisade fictional rules|Aturan fiksi Palisade|The sealed story protocol defines one adult copy twenty years earlier: same baseline genome, fingerprints and memories at creation; separate later histories; no teleportation or later memory synchronization. These are invented rules, not real science.|Protokol cerita tersegel menetapkan satu salinan dewasa dua puluh tahun lalu: genom, sidik jari, serta ingatan dasar sama saat pembuatan; riwayat belakangan terpisah; tanpa teleportasi atau sinkronisasi ingatan kemudian. Ini aturan ciptaan, bukan sains nyata.|The fictional framework allows matched baseline biology with different later identities.|Kerangka fiksi memungkinkan biologi dasar cocok dengan identitas belakangan berbeda.
Original subject register|Daftar subjek asli|The original signed register records Elias E1 and a single copied adult D2 at age 22. No later duplication event is recorded.|Daftar asli bertanda tangan mencatat Elias E1 serta satu dewasa salinan D2 pada usia 22. Tidak tercatat duplikasi belakangan.|The original experiment predates the two decades of separate adult histories.|Eksperimen asli mendahului dua dekade riwayat dewasa terpisah.
Public archive discrepancy|Ketidaksesuaian arsip publik|The public summary calls D2 a failed simulation. Independently preserved subject-care records continue for twenty years under D2.|Ringkasan publik menyebut D2 simulasi gagal. Catatan perawatan subjek yang disimpan independen berlanjut dua puluh tahun dengan D2.|The public account conflicts with ongoing records of a second person.|Laporan publik bertentangan dengan catatan berkelanjutan tentang orang kedua.
Acquired-mark records|Catatan tanda diperoleh kemudian|D2’s independently verified clinic record documents a later left-forearm injury. Elias’s continuous adult clinic history lacks that injury. The record is not used as a moral test.|Catatan klinik D2 terverifikasi independen mendokumentasikan cedera lengan kiri belakangan. Riwayat klinik dewasa Elias berkelanjutan tidak memiliki cedera itu. Catatan bukan tes moral.|A post-creation physical difference can discriminate between the matched baseline bodies.|Perbedaan fisik sesudah pembuatan dapat membedakan tubuh dengan dasar cocok.
Memory comparison transcripts|Transkrip pembandingan memori|Both recall the same childhood melody. Only Elias recalls the public conference career; D2 recalls controlled research residences. External records corroborate these later contexts.|Keduanya mengingat melodi masa kecil sama. Hanya Elias mengingat karier konferensi publik; D2 mengingat kediaman riset terkontrol. Catatan luar menguatkan konteks belakangan.|Shared early memory is compatible with divergent independently documented later experience.|Ingatan awal bersama sesuai dengan pengalaman belakangan berbeda yang terdokumentasi independen.
D2 identity continuity|Kesinambungan identitas D2|A verified civil identity record connects D2’s later name Silas Voss to the continuous subject and clinic records. It does not rely solely on his spoken claim.|Catatan identitas sipil terverifikasi menghubungkan nama belakangan D2, Silas Voss, dengan catatan subjek serta klinik berkelanjutan. Tidak hanya mengandalkan klaim lisan.|The later personal identity has independent documentary continuity.|Identitas pribadi belakangan memiliki kesinambungan dokumen independen.
Token custody record|Catatan penguasaan token|The individually issued D2 hardware token is collected by Silas on independent camera before the sabotage. E1’s token remains at the conference desk.|Token perangkat individu D2 diambil Silas pada kamera independen sebelum sabotase. Token E1 tetap di meja konferensi.|Credential possession is independently linked to the respective person.|Penguasaan kredensial terhubung independen dengan masing-masing orang.
Laboratory entrance sequence|Urutan masuk laboratorium|Continuous footage follows the D2-token holder with the documented acquired forearm mark from entry to the damaged equipment and departure.|Rekaman tanpa jeda mengikuti pemegang token D2 bertanda lengan diperoleh kemudian dari masuk ke alat rusak hingga pergi.|A continuous movement record links the distinguishing identity markers to the act.|Catatan perpindahan berkelanjutan menghubungkan penanda pembeda identitas dengan tindakan.
Scene material comparison|Pembandingan material lokasi|A lawful independently documented recovery finds the recorded clothing in Silas’s controlled room with distinctive material from the damaged apparatus. This corroborates the video, not identity through genome alone.|Penemuan sah terdokumentasi independen menemukan pakaian terekam di ruang yang dikuasai Silas dengan material khas alat rusak. Ini menguatkan video, bukan identitas melalui genom saja.|Physical trace evidence corroborates the specific recorded sabotage sequence.|Bukti jejak fisik menguatkan urutan sabotase spesifik yang terekam.
Authenticated motive message|Pesan motif terautentikasi|Before the attack Silas states he will destroy the control hardware to stop renewed coercive testing. The message is authenticated and independently archived.|Sebelum serangan Silas menyatakan akan merusak perangkat kontrol untuk menghentikan pengujian paksaan baru. Pesan terautentikasi serta diarsipkan independen.|An explicit prior intention supports motive when joined to act evidence.|Niat sebelumnya yang eksplisit mendukung motif bila digabung bukti tindakan.
Director’s internal plan|Rencana internal direktur|Mira’s signed plan authorizes renewed D2 control trials despite the public simulation story. An independent board receipt confirms the plan predates the attack.|Rencana bertanda tangan Mira mengizinkan uji kontrol D2 baru meski cerita publik menyebut simulasi. Tanda terima dewan independen memastikan rencana mendahului serangan.|Institutional concealment is evidenced independently of the attacker’s responsibility.|Penyembunyian institusional dibuktikan terpisah dari tanggung jawab penyerang.
Guard injury account|Keterangan cedera penjaga|The injured guard’s account matches the continuous apparatus-area video. The injury occurred during the D2-token holder’s destructive action.|Keterangan penjaga cedera sesuai video area alat tanpa jeda. Cedera terjadi saat tindakan perusakan pemegang token D2.|A claimed protective motive does not erase the documented harm.|Motif perlindungan yang diklaim tidak menghapus kerugian terdokumentasi.
Identity synthesis|Sintesis identitas|The fictional baseline copy explains shared biology. Independent conference continuity supports Elias’s alibi; acquired marks, D2 custody, continuous footage and material recovery identify Silas’s conduct.|Salinan dasar fiksi menjelaskan biologi bersama. Kesinambungan konferensi independen mendukung alibi Elias; tanda diperoleh kemudian, penguasaan D2, rekaman tanpa jeda, serta material ditemukan mengidentifikasi tindakan Silas.|Biological similarity, personal continuity and responsibility must be established separately.|Kesamaan biologis, kesinambungan pribadi, serta tanggung jawab perlu dipastikan terpisah.''')
vf(c,'Which model fits the explicitly fictional rules and records?','Model mana sesuai aturan fiksi eksplisit serta catatan?','One baseline adult copy followed by twenty years of separate lives','Satu salinan dewasa dasar diikuti dua puluh tahun kehidupan terpisah',[('Unlimited recent copies with synchronized current memories','Salinan baru tanpa batas dengan ingatan kini tersinkron'),('One person teleporting without a recorded rule','Satu orang berteleportasi tanpa aturan tercatat'),('A DNA match alone disproves the conference recording','Kecocokan DNA saja membantah rekaman konferensi')],'The original register and bounded protocol explain similarity without collapsing personal identity.','Daftar asli serta protokol terbatas menjelaskan kesamaan tanpa menyatukan identitas pribadi.')
vf(c,'Who committed the supported sabotage?','Siapa melakukan sabotase yang didukung?','Silas Voss, the person with documented D2 continuity','Silas Voss, orang dengan kesinambungan D2 terdokumentasi',[('Elias Voss despite continuous distant footage','Elias Voss meski rekaman jauh berkelanjutan'),('Mira Sol solely because she concealed the project','Mira Sol hanya karena menyembunyikan proyek'),('The guard because he was injured','Penjaga karena ia cedera')],'Acquired mark, token custody, continuous action footage and recovered material distinguish the actor.','Tanda diperoleh kemudian, penguasaan token, rekaman tindakan tanpa jeda, serta material ditemukan membedakan pelaku.')
vf(c,'What distinguishes responsibility most strongly?','Apa yang paling kuat membedakan tanggung jawab?','Independently documented movements and acquired markers connected to the act','Perpindahan serta penanda diperoleh kemudian yang terdokumentasi independen dan terkait tindakan',[('Which person sounds more like the original','Siapa terdengar lebih seperti yang asli'),('Which genome seems more authentic','Genom mana tampak lebih asli'),('Shared childhood memory alone','Ingatan masa kecil bersama saja')],'Responsibility attaches to evidenced conduct, not authenticity judgments.','Tanggung jawab melekat pada tindakan terbukti, bukan penilaian keaslian.')
vf(c,'What did the laboratory conceal?','Apa yang disembunyikan laboratorium?','An ongoing second adult subject behind a false failed-simulation account','Subjek dewasa kedua berkelanjutan di balik laporan simulasi gagal palsu',[('A proven real-world cloning method with no invented rules','Metode kloning dunia nyata terbukti tanpa aturan ciptaan'),('A conference that never occurred','Konferensi yang tak pernah terjadi'),('That matching biology necessarily means one person','Bahwa biologi cocok pasti berarti satu orang')],'Continuing care records and the signed renewed plan contradict the public summary.','Catatan perawatan berlanjut serta rencana baru bertanda tangan bertentangan dengan ringkasan publik.')
tool(c,'identity',3,'Dual-identity comparison board','Papan pembandingan identitas ganda','Compare baseline biology, acquired differences, memory sources and independent movement records. The duplication rules are fictional and explicitly bounded.','Bandingkan biologi dasar, perbedaan diperoleh kemudian, sumber memori, serta catatan gerak independen. Aturan duplikasi bersifat fiksi serta terbatas eksplisit.',[
('Shared baseline','Dasar bersama','E1 and D2 share the story’s copied genome, fingerprints and memories at age 22. The rule does not synchronize any later experience.','E1 serta D2 berbagi genom, sidik jari, serta ingatan yang disalin pada usia 22 dalam cerita. Aturan tidak menyinkronkan pengalaman belakangan.'),('Acquired differences','Perbedaan diperoleh kemudian','D2’s later left-forearm injury is independently documented; Elias’s adult record lacks it. A post-copy difference can distinguish individuals without ranking them.','Cedera lengan kiri D2 belakangan terdokumentasi independen; catatan dewasa Elias tidak memuatnya. Perbedaan sesudah penyalinan dapat membedakan individu tanpa memberi peringkat.'),('Memory sources','Sumber memori','Early melody: shared. Later conference career: Elias. Controlled residence: D2. External records test these contexts; convincing recollection alone is not attribution.','Melodi awal: bersama. Karier konferensi belakangan: Elias. Kediaman terkontrol: D2. Catatan luar menguji konteks ini; ingatan meyakinkan saja bukan atribusi.'),('Continuity test','Uji kesinambungan','Compare an independently recorded location with each claimed later identity. A matching baseline sample cannot override a verified simultaneous distant presence.','Bandingkan lokasi terekam independen dengan masing-masing identitas belakangan yang diklaim. Sampel dasar cocok tidak dapat membatalkan kehadiran jauh bersamaan yang terverifikasi.')],['E16-07','E16-08'])
c=case(17,'The Impossible Witness','Saksi yang Mustahil','Administrative patterns & financial reconstruction','Pola administratif & rekonstruksi keuangan','Orion Corporate Investigations Unit','Unit Investigasi Korporasi Orion',
'Consultant Mara Quinn is found dead after an internal audit. Three executives have solid alibis. Records clerk Noor Bell notices the wrong courier pouch in an office photograph. Follow the small discrepancy through ordinary approvals.',
'Konsultan Mara Quinn ditemukan tewas setelah audit internal. Tiga eksekutif memiliki alibi kuat. Petugas arsip Noor Bell melihat kantong kurir yang keliru dalam foto kantor. Ikuti ketidaksesuaian kecil melalui persetujuan biasa.',
'Office photograph|Courier desk|Reimbursement archive|Approval ledger|Schedule comparison|Executive interviews|Document movements|Forensic review|Conspiracy reconstruction','Foto kantor|Meja kurir|Arsip penggantian biaya|Buku persetujuan|Pembandingan jadwal|Wawancara eksekutif|Perpindahan dokumen|Tinjauan forensik|Rekonstruksi konspirasi',[
('Mara Quinn','Deceased audit consultant','Konsultan audit korban',40,'Mara traced duplicate service invoices and requested original delivery stubs.','Mara menelusuri faktur layanan ganda serta meminta stub pengiriman asli.','Her authenticated request identifies the pouch series used for the original approvals.','Permintaan terautentikasinya mengidentifikasi seri kantong untuk persetujuan asli.'),('Noor Bell','Civilian records clerk','Petugas arsip sipil',28,'The pouch in that photograph belongs to the north-annex night route. I file its carbon copies every week.','Kantong dalam foto itu milik rute malam bangunan utara. Saya mengarsipkan salinan karbonnya setiap minggu.','The pouch number is a lead we can check against issued stock, not proof by itself.','Nomor kantong adalah petunjuk yang bisa dibandingkan dengan stok diterbitkan, bukan bukti tersendiri.'),('Adrian Kestrel','Chief financial officer','Direktur keuangan',51,'My board-call alibi is continuous. I was not in Mara’s office.','Alibi panggilan dewan saya berkelanjutan. Saya tidak di kantor Mara.','My approval key signed the supplier substitutions; physical absence does not explain those approvals.','Kunci persetujuan saya menandatangani substitusi pemasok; ketidakhadiran fisik tidak menjelaskan persetujuan itu.'),('Miriam Lake','Chief executive','Direktur utama',48,'I approved the budget envelope, not each replacement vendor.','Saya menyetujui pagu anggaran, bukan tiap vendor pengganti.','The preserved workflow separates budget approval from supplier-identity override.','Alur kerja tersimpan memisahkan persetujuan anggaran dari penimpaan identitas pemasok.'),('Simon Tate','Procurement director','Direktur pengadaan',44,'My team entered the orders using an apparently valid approved vendor code.','Tim saya memasukkan pesanan dengan kode vendor disetujui yang tampak valid.','The vendor identity was changed after the ordinary review stage.','Identitas vendor diubah setelah tahap tinjauan biasa.'),('Lenora Vale','Document logistics manager','Manajer logistik dokumen',39,'The north-annex route did not enter the south tower that evening.','Rute bangunan utara tidak masuk menara selatan malam itu.','My individual dispatch token and the original courier camera can test that claim.','Token pengiriman individu saya serta kamera kurir asli bisa menguji klaim itu.')],
'Adrian Kestrel diverted service payments through a vendor-identity override after ordinary procurement review. Lenora Vale moved the original signed approvals out of the audit chain and substituted copies, using a north-annex courier pouch whose numbered stub appeared in the office photograph. Its route, reimbursement and physical scan records contradict her claimed movement schedule. When Mara demanded the originals, Lenora met her in the office and killed her with a heavy document press during a documented confrontation. Continuous access footage, the recovered blood-bearing press in Lenora’s exclusive dispatch locker, matched broken components and an independently preserved audio segment corroborate that act. Kestrel’s authenticated message instructed Lenora to recover the originals and “silence the audit,” but does not independently establish that he ordered a killing; the documented evidence supports his financial fraud and obstruction, while Lenora’s physical conduct supports homicide responsibility. The executives’ real remote alibis exclude physical presence, not their separate financial acts. Miriam’s budget approval and Simon’s ordinary order entries do not prove knowing complicity in the later override. Noor’s observation opened a testable trail; no conclusion rests on exceptional intelligence alone.',
'Adrian Kestrel mengalihkan pembayaran layanan melalui penimpaan identitas vendor setelah tinjauan pengadaan biasa. Lenora Vale memindahkan persetujuan asli bertanda tangan dari rantai audit serta menggantinya dengan salinan, memakai kantong kurir bangunan utara yang stub bernomornya tampak pada foto kantor. Catatan rute, penggantian biaya, serta pindai fisik bertentangan dengan jadwal gerak yang ia klaim. Saat Mara meminta dokumen asli, Lenora menemuinya di kantor serta membunuhnya dengan pres dokumen berat dalam konfrontasi terdokumentasi. Rekaman akses tanpa jeda, pres berdarah ditemukan di loker pengiriman eksklusif Lenora, komponen patah cocok, serta segmen audio disimpan independen menguatkan tindakan itu. Pesan terautentikasi Kestrel memerintah Lenora mengambil dokumen asli serta “bungkam audit”, tetapi tidak secara independen memastikan ia memerintah pembunuhan; bukti terdokumentasi mendukung penipuan keuangan serta penghalangan olehnya, sementara tindakan fisik Lenora mendukung tanggung jawab pembunuhan. Alibi jarak jauh eksekutif yang nyata menyingkirkan kehadiran fisik, bukan tindakan keuangan terpisah. Persetujuan anggaran Miriam serta entri pesanan biasa Simon tidak membuktikan keterlibatan sadar dalam penimpaan belakangan. Pengamatan Noor membuka jejak yang dapat diuji; tidak ada kesimpulan bertumpu pada kecerdasan luar biasa saja.')
vrecords(c,'''Office scene photograph|Foto lokasi kantor|The original scene image shows courier pouch N4-218 beside Mara’s desk. A small violet route tab is legible under magnification; the photograph is authenticated.|Foto lokasi asli menunjukkan kantong kurir N4-218 di samping meja Mara. Tab rute ungu kecil terbaca saat diperbesar; foto terautentikasi.|A minor visible detail provides a verifiable administrative lead.|Detail kecil terlihat memberi petunjuk administratif yang dapat diverifikasi.
Issued-pouch register|Daftar kantong diterbitkan|N4-218 belongs to the north-annex night route managed by Lenora. The register tracks that individual number, not merely a common pouch color.|N4-218 milik rute malam bangunan utara yang dikelola Lenora. Daftar melacak nomor individu itu, bukan sekadar warna umum kantong.|An individual stock number is more discriminating than a shared visual style.|Nomor stok individu lebih membedakan daripada gaya visual bersama.
Claimed delivery schedule|Jadwal pengiriman diklaim|The submitted schedule says N4 stayed at the north annex until after the death discovery. Its file was uploaded later than the physical scan records.|Jadwal diajukan menyebut N4 tetap di bangunan utara sampai setelah penemuan kematian. Berkas diunggah lebih lambat daripada catatan pindai fisik.|A submitted administrative schedule must be tested against contemporaneous movement records.|Jadwal administratif diajukan perlu diuji terhadap catatan gerak sezaman.
Original courier scans|Pindai kurir asli|Independent physical scans place N4-218 at the south tower before Mara’s final verified meeting. The stored scan signatures predate the submitted schedule.|Pindai fisik independen menempatkan N4-218 di menara selatan sebelum pertemuan terakhir Mara terverifikasi. Tanda tangan pindai tersimpan mendahului jadwal diajukan.|Contemporaneous scans contradict the claimed late delivery time.|Pindai sezaman bertentangan dengan waktu pengiriman terlambat yang diklaim.
Expense reimbursement|Penggantian biaya|Lenora claims a north-only route, but a contemporaneous south-tower parking receipt is attached to her reimbursement. The merchant independently verifies it.|Lenora mengklaim rute hanya utara, tetapi kuitansi parkir menara selatan sezaman terlampir pada penggantiannya. Pedagang memverifikasinya independen.|An ordinary expense record independently tests the movement claim.|Catatan biaya biasa menguji klaim perpindahan secara independen.
Delivery carbon stub|Stub karbon pengiriman|The retained carbon for N4-218 lists original approval envelopes, while the later digital delivery line calls them blank supplies. The original recipient signature is preserved.|Karbon tersimpan N4-218 memuat amplop persetujuan asli, sementara entri pengiriman digital belakangan menyebut perlengkapan kosong. Tanda tangan penerima asli tersimpan.|The document description changed between physical custody and later reporting.|Deskripsi dokumen berubah antara penguasaan fisik dan pelaporan belakangan.
Audit request|Permintaan audit|Mara’s signed request seeks the originals behind duplicate service payments. It names N4-218’s approval-envelope series before her final meeting.|Permintaan bertanda tangan Mara meminta dokumen asli di balik pembayaran layanan ganda. Permintaan menyebut seri amplop persetujuan N4-218 sebelum pertemuan terakhirnya.|The unusual pouch is connected to the audit rather than a random office object.|Kantong tak biasa terkait audit, bukan benda kantor acak.
Procurement baseline|Dasar pengadaan|Ordinary procurement review approved vendor V-A for a real service. Budget approval and vendor identity changes are separate permissions.|Tinjauan pengadaan biasa menyetujui vendor V-A untuk layanan nyata. Persetujuan anggaran serta perubahan identitas vendor adalah izin terpisah.|A legitimate early approval does not authorize an undisclosed later substitution.|Persetujuan awal sah tidak mengizinkan substitusi belakangan yang tersembunyi.
Vendor override history|Riwayat penimpaan vendor|After ordinary review, Kestrel’s hardware key replaces the beneficiary identity behind the vendor code. An immutable payment audit preserves both versions.|Setelah tinjauan biasa, kunci perangkat Kestrel mengganti identitas penerima di balik kode vendor. Audit pembayaran tetap menyimpan kedua versi.|The financial diversion can occur after otherwise legitimate administrative actions.|Pengalihan keuangan dapat terjadi setelah tindakan administratif lain yang sah.
Beneficiary verification|Verifikasi penerima manfaat|Independent registry and banking records link the replacement beneficiary to a company controlled by Kestrel. No such ownership link is found for the ordinary entry clerks.|Catatan registrasi serta bank independen menghubungkan penerima pengganti dengan perusahaan yang dikuasai Kestrel. Hubungan kepemilikan semacam itu tidak ditemukan pada petugas entri biasa.|Recipient ownership independently corroborates the financial motive and benefit.|Kepemilikan penerima secara independen menguatkan motif serta manfaat keuangan.
Executive alibi bundle|Berkas alibi eksekutif|Three independently preserved remote-event recordings cover Kestrel, Miriam and Simon during the office confrontation. Their physical alibis are genuine.|Tiga rekaman acara jarak jauh disimpan independen mencakup Kestrel, Miriam, Simon saat konfrontasi kantor. Alibi fisik mereka asli.|A genuine physical alibi does not resolve separately evidenced remote financial conduct.|Alibi fisik asli tidak menyelesaikan tindakan keuangan jarak jauh yang terbukti terpisah.
Individual dispatch access|Akses pengiriman individu|Lenora’s hardware dispatch token and clear corridor footage place her at Mara’s office during the final meeting. Other executives remain remote.|Token pengiriman perangkat Lenora serta rekaman koridor jelas menempatkannya di kantor Mara saat pertemuan terakhir. Eksekutif lain tetap jarak jauh.|Independent access evidence identifies a physical opportunity outside the executive shortlist.|Bukti akses independen mengidentifikasi kesempatan fisik di luar daftar eksekutif.
Original-envelope comparison|Pembandingan amplop asli|Recovered originals have wet signatures and carbon impressions absent from the substituted scans. The copy revision dates follow Mara’s request.|Dokumen asli ditemukan memiliki tanda tangan tinta serta tekanan karbon yang tidak ada pada pindai pengganti. Tanggal revisi salinan mengikuti permintaan Mara.|The comparison supports deliberate replacement of evidentiary originals with incomplete copies.|Pembandingan mendukung penggantian sengaja dokumen asli pembuktian dengan salinan tak lengkap.
Logistics instruction message|Pesan instruksi logistik|Kestrel’s authenticated message tells Lenora to recover the originals and “silence the audit.” It does not explicitly instruct violence.|Pesan terautentikasi Kestrel meminta Lenora mengambil dokumen asli serta “bungkam audit.” Pesan tidak secara eksplisit memerintah kekerasan.|Obstruction instructions do not by themselves establish an order to kill.|Instruksi penghalangan tidak dengan sendirinya memastikan perintah membunuh.
Preserved meeting audio|Audio pertemuan tersimpan|An independently archived office recorder captures Mara confronting Lenora about the originals, followed by a struggle. It is consistent with the access-video interval.|Perekam kantor diarsipkan independen menangkap Mara menuntut Lenora soal dokumen asli, diikuti pergumulan. Rekaman sesuai rentang video akses.|A contemporaneous confrontation corroborates the physical sequence but needs forensic interpretation.|Konfrontasi sezaman menguatkan urutan fisik tetapi memerlukan tafsir forensik.
Press recovery and fracture|Penemuan pres serta patahan|A lawful search of Lenora’s sole-access dispatch locker finds the missing heavy press with Mara’s blood. A broken component physically fits the scene fragment.|Penggeledahan sah loker pengiriman akses tunggal Lenora menemukan pres berat hilang dengan darah Mara. Komponen patah cocok secara fisik dengan fragmen lokasi.|Controlled recovery and a physical fit connect the object to the scene independently.|Penemuan terkendali serta kecocokan fisik menghubungkan benda dengan lokasi secara independen.
Forensic mechanism report|Laporan mekanisme forensik|Blunt-force injuries are compatible with the recovered press class. The examiner distinguishes compatibility from the stronger physical fracture association.|Cedera tumpul sesuai kelas pres ditemukan. Pemeriksa membedakan kesesuaian dari hubungan patahan fisik yang lebih kuat.|Mechanism evidence must retain its limitations even when other links are strong.|Bukti mekanisme perlu mempertahankan batasnya meski hubungan lain kuat.
Ordinary approval-chain interviews|Wawancara rantai persetujuan biasa|Miriam’s budget instruction and Simon’s entry logs predate the hidden override. No authenticated communication shows they knew the later beneficiary substitution or violence.|Instruksi anggaran Miriam serta catatan entri Simon mendahului penimpaan tersembunyi. Tidak ada komunikasi terautentikasi menunjukkan mereka mengetahui substitusi penerima atau kekerasan belakangan.|Routine participation does not establish knowing involvement in every later act.|Keikutsertaan rutin tidak memastikan keterlibatan sadar dalam semua tindakan belakangan.
Reconciled administrative timeline|Linimasa administratif diselaraskan|Ordinary review, beneficiary override, audit request, original-envelope movement, substituted copies and the final confrontation appear in independently checked order.|Tinjauan biasa, penimpaan penerima, permintaan audit, perpindahan amplop asli, salinan pengganti, serta konfrontasi akhir muncul dalam urutan yang diperiksa independen.|A joined chronology explains how legitimate steps concealed later unauthorized acts.|Kronologi gabungan menjelaskan bagaimana langkah sah menyembunyikan tindakan tanpa izin belakangan.
Responsibility matrix|Matriks tanggung jawab|Financial signatures and beneficiary records implicate Kestrel in diversion and obstruction. Physical access, meeting audio and the recovered press implicate Lenora in the death. Their evidentiary roles are distinct.|Tanda tangan keuangan serta catatan penerima mengaitkan Kestrel dengan pengalihan serta penghalangan. Akses fisik, audio pertemuan, serta pres ditemukan mengaitkan Lenora dengan kematian. Peran buktinya berbeda.|Each allegation requires its own supported link rather than guilt by association.|Setiap tuduhan memerlukan hubungan didukungnya sendiri, bukan kesalahan karena asosiasi.''')
vf(c,'What made the small photographic detail useful?','Apa yang membuat detail foto kecil itu berguna?','The numbered pouch could be checked against independent stock, scan and receipt records','Kantong bernomor dapat diperiksa terhadap catatan stok, pindai, serta kuitansi independen',[('The violet color alone identified a murderer','Warna ungu saja mengidentifikasi pembunuh'),('Noor’s intelligence made verification unnecessary','Kecerdasan Noor membuat verifikasi tak perlu'),('Every office pouch contains original approvals','Semua kantong kantor memuat persetujuan asli')],'The observation generated a verifiable trail rather than an instant accusation.','Pengamatan menghasilkan jejak dapat diverifikasi, bukan tuduhan seketika.')
vf(c,'Who is linked to the financial diversion?','Siapa terhubung dengan pengalihan keuangan?','Adrian Kestrel through the signed beneficiary override and ownership records','Adrian Kestrel melalui penimpaan penerima bertanda tangan serta catatan kepemilikan',[('Every ordinary entry clerk equally','Semua petugas entri biasa secara sama'),('Miriam solely through budget approval','Miriam hanya melalui persetujuan anggaran'),('Noor because she noticed the pouch','Noor karena melihat kantong')],'Independent authorization and benefit identify the financial act.','Izin serta manfaat independen mengidentifikasi tindakan keuangan.')
vf(c,'Who is supported as physically responsible for Mara’s death?','Siapa didukung sebagai pihak bertanggung jawab fisik atas kematian Mara?','Lenora Vale','Lenora Vale',[('Kestrel based solely on the phrase silence the audit','Kestrel hanya berdasarkan kalimat bungkam audit'),('Simon despite the independent remote alibi','Simon meski alibi jarak jauh independen'),('Noor based on unusual observational ability','Noor berdasarkan kemampuan pengamatan tak biasa')],'Access continuity, confrontation audio and the recovered blood-bearing press converge on Lenora.','Kesinambungan akses, audio konfrontasi, serta pres berdarah ditemukan mengarah pada Lenora.')
vf(c,'How were ordinary workplace steps used?','Bagaimana langkah tempat kerja biasa dipakai?','A later identity override and original-document replacement hid unauthorized acts behind valid earlier approvals','Penimpaan identitas belakangan serta penggantian dokumen asli menyembunyikan tindakan tanpa izin di balik persetujuan awal sah',[('Every budget decision was fabricated from the start','Semua keputusan anggaran direkayasa sejak awal'),('The executives’ alibis were all false','Alibi eksekutif semuanya palsu'),('Courier color caused the payment diversion','Warna kurir menyebabkan pengalihan pembayaran')],'Version order and custody records distinguish legitimate steps from subsequent changes.','Urutan versi serta catatan penguasaan membedakan langkah sah dari perubahan berikutnya.')
vf(c,'What remains unsupported about Kestrel’s message?','Apa yang tetap tidak didukung tentang pesan Kestrel?','That it independently proves he ordered a killing','Bahwa pesan secara independen membuktikan ia memerintah pembunuhan',[('That it instructed recovery of originals','Bahwa pesan memerintah pengambilan dokumen asli'),('That its sender was authenticated','Bahwa pengirim terautentikasi'),('That it bears on obstruction','Bahwa pesan relevan terhadap penghalangan')],'The case separates evidence of obstruction from proof of a specific violent instruction.','Kasus memisahkan bukti penghalangan dari bukti instruksi kekerasan spesifik.')
tool(c,'admin',4,'Administrative discrepancy desk','Meja ketidaksesuaian administratif','Inspect the tiny pouch label, then compare physical movement, expenses and document versions. A visual lead only matters when independent records connect it.','Periksa label kantong kecil, lalu bandingkan gerak fisik, biaya, serta versi dokumen. Petunjuk visual hanya berarti jika catatan independen menghubungkannya.',[
('Photograph detail','Detail foto','Magnified label: N4-218, violet north-annex tab. The individually numbered pouch is at Mara’s desk in the authenticated scene photograph.','Label diperbesar: N4-218, tab ungu bangunan utara. Kantong bernomor individu berada di meja Mara pada foto lokasi terautentikasi.'),('Movement comparison','Pembandingan gerak','Submitted schedule: north until late. Original scans: south tower before the final meeting. The physical scan signatures precede the submitted schedule.','Jadwal diajukan: utara sampai larut. Pindai asli: menara selatan sebelum pertemuan terakhir. Tanda tangan pindai fisik mendahului jadwal diajukan.'),('Expense cross-check','Pemeriksaan silang biaya','A south-tower parking receipt on Lenora’s reimbursement contradicts the north-only route claim. Merchant verification supplies an independent source.','Kuitansi parkir menara selatan pada penggantian Lenora bertentangan dengan klaim rute hanya utara. Verifikasi pedagang memberi sumber independen.'),('Document version check','Pemeriksaan versi dokumen','Carbon stub: original approval envelopes. Later digital line: blank supplies. Mara’s prior audit request names the same envelope series.','Stub karbon: amplop persetujuan asli. Entri digital belakangan: perlengkapan kosong. Permintaan audit lama Mara menyebut seri amplop sama.')],['E17-09','E17-10','E17-11'])
c=case(18,'The Child Who Remembered Everything','Anak yang Mengingat Segalanya','Cold-case archives & corroborated memory','Arsip kasus lama & memori terkonfirmasi','State Bureau and former Ashgrove Care Home','Biro Negara serta Bekas Rumah Asuh Ashgrove',
'Lena Arden, 30, recalls a disappearance she witnessed at six. A locked basement, a familiar pendant and an overheard conversation reopen a 2002 runaway file. Treat her memories as leads while rebuilding the documentary history.',
'Lena Arden, 30 tahun, mengingat hilangnya seseorang yang ia saksikan pada usia enam. Ruang bawah tanah terkunci, liontin dikenal, serta percakapan terdengar membuka kembali berkas kabur 2002. Perlakukan ingatannya sebagai petunjuk sambil membangun ulang riwayat dokumen.',
'Trauma-informed intake|2002 police archive|Property history|Placement records|Memory source review|Transfer correspondence|Family verification|Financial audit|Cold-case synthesis','Penerimaan peka trauma|Arsip polisi 2002|Sejarah properti|Catatan penempatan|Tinjauan sumber memori|Korespondensi pemindahan|Verifikasi keluarga|Audit keuangan|Sintesis kasus lama',[
('Lena Arden','Adult witness and former resident','Saksi dewasa serta mantan penghuni',30,'I remember the metal basement door and two adults talking. Some details may have come from things I saw later.','Saya ingat pintu logam ruang bawah tanah serta dua orang dewasa berbicara. Beberapa detail mungkin berasal dari hal yang saya lihat kemudian.','I want the records checked without being told what I am supposed to remember.','Saya ingin catatan diperiksa tanpa diberi tahu apa yang seharusnya saya ingat.'),('Daniel Reed','Adult with a possible missing-child identity','Dewasa dengan kemungkinan identitas anak hilang',32,'I was raised under this name. I can choose whether to participate in the identification process.','Saya dibesarkan dengan nama ini. Saya bisa memilih apakah ikut proses identifikasi.','With my consent, independent records and family comparison can test the proposed identity.','Dengan persetujuan saya, catatan independen serta pembandingan keluarga dapat menguji identitas yang diusulkan.'),('Helena Rook','Former care-home director','Mantan direktur rumah asuh',68,'The official file says Tommy Vale ran away. That was the finding at the time.','Berkas resmi menyebut Tommy Vale kabur. Itu temuan saat itu.','My signature appears on a separate private transfer authorization dated the same day.','Tanda tangan saya muncul pada izin pemindahan privat terpisah pada hari sama.'),('Gareth Pike','Former transport officer','Mantan petugas transportasi',61,'I delivered a child under instructions that were presented as authorized placement.','Saya mengantar seorang anak berdasarkan instruksi yang disajikan sebagai penempatan berizin.','The private transport ledger and the later amended police statement need to be compared.','Buku transportasi privat serta keterangan polisi yang diubah kemudian perlu dibandingkan.'),('Marian Ellis','Receiving caregiver','Pengasuh penerima',59,'I was told the placement had lawful approval. I kept the original receipt and clinic correspondence.','Saya diberi tahu penempatan memiliki persetujuan sah. Saya menyimpan kuitansi asli serta korespondensi klinik.','Those papers identify the institution and transport date independently of Lena’s memory.','Dokumen itu mengidentifikasi institusi serta tanggal transportasi secara independen dari ingatan Lena.'),('Dr. Saira Bell','Cold-case interviewer','Pewawancara kasus lama',46,'A vivid recollection can guide a search without establishing every detail. We use open questions and record uncertainty.','Ingatan jelas dapat memandu pencarian tanpa memastikan setiap detail. Kami memakai pertanyaan terbuka serta mencatat ketidakpastian.','The identity assessment and responsibility findings must rest on independently checked records, not a demand for perfect recall.','Penilaian identitas serta temuan tanggung jawab harus bertumpu pada catatan diperiksa independen, bukan tuntutan ingatan sempurna.')],
'Tommy Vale did not run away on 14 May 2002. Helena Rook authorized an undisclosed private placement and received a payment outside the institution’s approved accounts. Gareth Pike transported the child, then knowingly replaced his original transport statement with the runaway account after receiving an authenticated instruction to omit the journey. The original private ledger, receiving caregiver’s receipt, independently archived clinic correspondence, payment records and the director’s signed transfer authorization reconstruct the movement. With his informed consent, adult Daniel Reed is identified as Tommy through documentary continuity and an independent family DNA comparison; he retains agency over his name and family contact. Marian’s retained papers support that she was told the placement was authorized; the record does not establish her knowing participation in the concealment. Lena’s early recollection of the metal door is compatible with historic plans, but the remembered pendant is a common design she also saw in a later archive photograph. The basement was a locked records store, not a proven confinement room. Those distinctions do not discredit Lena or diminish the documented institutional failure. Surviving evidence supports the unauthorized transfer and deliberate false reporting while leaving some conversations and subjective details unresolved. The case uses no recovered-memory technique and treats former children’s experiences with respect.',
'Tommy Vale tidak kabur pada 14 Mei 2002. Helena Rook mengizinkan penempatan privat tersembunyi serta menerima pembayaran di luar rekening institusi yang disetujui. Gareth Pike mengangkut anak itu, lalu dengan sadar mengganti keterangan transportasi aslinya menjadi cerita kabur setelah menerima instruksi terautentikasi untuk menghilangkan perjalanan. Buku privat asli, kuitansi pengasuh penerima, korespondensi klinik diarsipkan independen, catatan pembayaran, serta izin pemindahan bertanda tangan direktur merekonstruksi gerak. Dengan persetujuan terinformasinya, Daniel Reed dewasa diidentifikasi sebagai Tommy melalui kesinambungan dokumen serta pembandingan DNA keluarga independen; ia mempertahankan kendali atas nama serta kontak keluarganya. Dokumen Marian yang disimpan mendukung bahwa ia diberi tahu penempatan berizin; catatan tidak memastikan keterlibatan sadarnya dalam penyembunyian. Ingatan awal Lena tentang pintu logam sesuai dengan denah historis, tetapi liontin yang diingat adalah desain umum yang juga ia lihat pada foto arsip belakangan. Ruang bawah tanah adalah penyimpanan arsip terkunci, bukan ruang penahanan terbukti. Perbedaan itu tidak mendiskreditkan Lena atau mengurangi kegagalan institusional terdokumentasi. Bukti tersisa mendukung pemindahan tanpa izin serta pelaporan palsu sengaja sementara beberapa percakapan serta detail subjektif tetap belum terjawab. Kasus tidak memakai teknik pemulihan memori serta menghormati pengalaman mantan anak asuh.')
vrecords(c,'''Open-question intake|Penerimaan pertanyaan terbuka|Lena reports a metal door and adults discussing a departure. The interviewer records her uncertainty and does not supply names, jewelry details or an expected conclusion.|Lena melaporkan pintu logam serta orang dewasa membahas keberangkatan. Pewawancara mencatat ketidakpastian serta tidak memberi nama, detail perhiasan, atau kesimpulan yang diharapkan.|A carefully preserved account generates leads without treating every detail as established fact.|Keterangan tersimpan hati-hati menghasilkan petunjuk tanpa menganggap tiap detail sebagai fakta pasti.
Original missing report|Laporan hilang asli|Tommy Vale, age eight, is reported missing on 14 May 2002. The later runaway classification cites a revised transport statement rather than an independent departure sighting.|Tommy Vale, delapan tahun, dilaporkan hilang 14 Mei 2002. Klasifikasi kabur belakangan mengutip keterangan transportasi direvisi, bukan penampakan keberangkatan independen.|An official classification requires examination of its underlying source.|Klasifikasi resmi memerlukan pemeriksaan sumber dasarnya.
Historic property plan|Denah properti historis|The 2002 certified plan identifies a metal-doored basement records store. It does not label a residential or confinement room there.|Denah tersertifikasi 2002 mengidentifikasi gudang arsip bawah tanah berpintu logam. Tidak melabelinya ruang hunian atau penahanan.|A remembered location can be corroborated without proving a specific use of that room.|Lokasi yang diingat dapat dikuatkan tanpa membuktikan pemakaian ruangan tertentu.
Reopened basement examination|Pemeriksaan ulang ruang bawah tanah|Investigators document the surviving metal door, archive shelving and indexed storage boxes. No examined trace independently establishes that Tommy was confined there.|Penyidik mendokumentasikan pintu logam tersisa, rak arsip, serta kotak penyimpanan berindeks. Tidak ada jejak diperiksa yang secara independen memastikan Tommy ditahan di sana.|Present physical findings constrain rather than complete the remembered scene.|Temuan fisik kini membatasi, bukan melengkapi seluruh adegan yang diingat.
Placement-register discrepancy|Ketidaksesuaian daftar penempatan|The public register marks Tommy absent without transfer authority. A separately retained institution ledger lists a same-day private movement under code T-14.|Daftar publik menandai Tommy tidak ada tanpa izin pemindahan. Buku institusi tersimpan terpisah memuat perpindahan privat hari sama berkode T-14.|Two independently preserved records describe incompatible administrative histories.|Dua catatan tersimpan independen menjelaskan riwayat administratif tak sesuai.
Jewelry design review|Tinjauan desain perhiasan|The crescent pendant Lena describes was widely sold. An archive photograph she viewed as an adult shows the same design on a staff member.|Liontin sabit yang dijelaskan Lena dijual luas. Foto arsip yang dilihatnya saat dewasa menunjukkan desain sama pada staf.|A familiar common object does not uniquely identify a person or memory source.|Benda umum dikenal tidak mengidentifikasi orang atau sumber ingatan secara unik.
Memory exposure history|Riwayat paparan memori|Lena’s first preserved adult note mentions the door but not the pendant. The pendant detail appears after her documented archive-photo viewing.|Catatan dewasa pertama Lena yang tersimpan menyebut pintu tetapi bukan liontin. Detail liontin muncul setelah melihat foto arsip yang terdokumentasi.|The added detail has a plausible later information source without implying intentional dishonesty.|Detail tambahan memiliki sumber informasi belakangan yang masuk akal tanpa menyiratkan ketidakjujuran sengaja.
Original transport statement|Keterangan transportasi asli|Gareth’s signed initial statement records a T-14 trip to a receiving household. A contemporaneous carbon survives outside the police amendment file.|Keterangan awal bertanda tangan Gareth mencatat perjalanan T-14 ke rumah penerima. Karbon sezaman tersisa di luar berkas perubahan polisi.|An external contemporaneous copy can test a later institutional narrative.|Salinan luar sezaman dapat menguji narasi institusional belakangan.
Amended police statement|Keterangan polisi diubah|The later version removes T-14 and says no authorized transport occurred. Gareth signs the amendment after the director’s message instructing omission of the journey.|Versi belakangan menghapus T-14 serta menyebut tidak ada transportasi berizin. Gareth menandatangani perubahan setelah pesan direktur memerintah penghilangan perjalanan.|The order of instruction and revision supports deliberate omission rather than a simple missing file.|Urutan instruksi serta revisi mendukung penghilangan sengaja, bukan sekadar berkas hilang.
Director’s transfer authority|Izin pemindahan direktur|An independently archived original bears Helena’s verified signature authorizing private T-14 placement on the missing-report date. No matching statutory approval is found after a documented search.|Dokumen asli diarsipkan independen membawa tanda tangan Helena terverifikasi yang mengizinkan penempatan privat T-14 pada tanggal laporan hilang. Tidak ditemukan persetujuan resmi sesuai setelah pencarian terdokumentasi.|A signed private authorization contradicts the no-transfer account while lawful approval remains unsupported.|Izin privat bertanda tangan bertentangan dengan cerita tanpa pemindahan sementara persetujuan sah tetap tidak didukung.
Receiving caregiver receipt|Kuitansi pengasuh penerima|Marian’s original dated receipt records arrival of the child from Ashgrove under T-14. Independent handwriting and paper review support its contemporaneous provenance, not every accompanying legal claim.|Kuitansi asli bertanggal Marian mencatat kedatangan anak dari Ashgrove dengan T-14. Tinjauan tulisan serta kertas independen mendukung asal sezamannya, bukan semua klaim hukum yang menyertainya.|Independent receipt evidence corroborates arrival without automatically validating the placement’s legality.|Bukti kuitansi independen menguatkan kedatangan tanpa otomatis memvalidasi keabsahan penempatan.
Clinic correspondence chain|Rantai korespondensi klinik|A clinic archive independently links the receiving child’s records to later Daniel Reed records through successive documented care transfers.|Arsip klinik secara independen menghubungkan catatan anak diterima dengan catatan Daniel Reed belakangan melalui pemindahan perawatan berturut terdokumentasi.|Documentary continuity can connect a historical child record to an adult identity.|Kesinambungan dokumen dapat menghubungkan catatan anak historis dengan identitas dewasa.
Consent-based family comparison|Pembandingan keluarga berbasis persetujuan|Daniel freely consents to an independently collected family DNA comparison. The result supports the proposed family relationship when combined with the documentary chain.|Daniel menyetujui secara bebas pembandingan DNA keluarga yang diambil independen. Hasil mendukung hubungan keluarga diusulkan bila digabungkan dengan rantai dokumen.|Consented biological corroboration supplements identity continuity rather than replacing personal agency.|Penguatan biologis berizin melengkapi kesinambungan identitas, bukan menggantikan agensi pribadi.
Historical payment record|Catatan pembayaran historis|Independent bank archives show a private placement payment to an account controlled by Helena, outside the institution’s approved fee ledger.|Arsip bank independen menunjukkan pembayaran penempatan privat ke rekening dikuasai Helena di luar buku biaya institusi disetujui.|A verified financial trail supplies a separate benefit and motive link.|Jejak keuangan terverifikasi memberi hubungan manfaat serta motif terpisah.
Archived omission message|Pesan penghilangan diarsipkan|Helena’s authenticated message tells Gareth to omit the private journey from the police version. An external recipient archive preserves the message before the signed amendment.|Pesan terautentikasi Helena memerintah Gareth menghilangkan perjalanan privat dari versi polisi. Arsip penerima luar menyimpan pesan sebelum perubahan bertanda tangan.|An authenticated instruction corroborates intentional concealment of the transfer.|Instruksi terautentikasi menguatkan penyembunyian sengaja pemindahan.
Staff-role comparison|Pembandingan peran staf|Employment and access records place Helena in authorization and Gareth in transport/reporting. Other staff performed ordinary care duties with no verified access to the private payment channel.|Catatan kerja serta akses menempatkan Helena pada perizinan serta Gareth pada transportasi/pelaporan. Staf lain menjalankan perawatan biasa tanpa akses terverifikasi ke saluran pembayaran privat.|Institutional responsibility must be tied to evidenced roles rather than assigned to all staff.|Tanggung jawab institusional perlu dikaitkan peran terbukti, bukan dibebankan pada semua staf.
Child-welfare inspection notes|Catatan inspeksi kesejahteraan anak|The contemporary inspector requested transfer originals but was given only the revised runaway summary. The request predates the archive closure.|Inspektur sezaman meminta dokumen pemindahan asli tetapi hanya diberi ringkasan kabur direvisi. Permintaan mendahului penutupan arsip.|The record shows an accountability request obstructed by selective disclosure.|Catatan menunjukkan permintaan pertanggungjawaban dihambat pengungkapan selektif.
Caregiver knowledge assessment|Penilaian pengetahuan pengasuh|Marian’s retained correspondence consistently says approval had been obtained. No independently preserved record shows she knew the police file would be falsified.|Korespondensi tersimpan Marian konsisten menyebut persetujuan sudah diperoleh. Tidak ada catatan disimpan independen menunjukkan ia tahu berkas polisi akan dipalsukan.|Receiving care and knowingly concealing a disappearance are distinct propositions.|Menerima pengasuhan serta sengaja menyembunyikan hilangnya seseorang adalah proposisi berbeda.
Adult identity and preferences|Identitas serta preferensi dewasa|Daniel’s identification is corroborated, but investigators record his chosen name and preferences for family contact. The case does not require him to adopt another identity publicly.|Identifikasi Daniel dikuatkan, tetapi penyidik mencatat nama pilihannya serta preferensi kontak keluarga. Kasus tidak mengharuskannya memakai identitas lain secara publik.|Establishing historical identity does not remove the adult’s choices about present life.|Memastikan identitas historis tidak menghapus pilihan orang dewasa atas kehidupan kini.
Corroborated history review|Tinjauan riwayat terkonfirmasi|Private authorization, transport carbon, receiving receipt, clinic continuity, family comparison and payment records establish the hidden placement. Some remembered words and the basement’s alleged use remain unresolved.|Izin privat, karbon transportasi, kuitansi penerima, kesinambungan klinik, pembandingan keluarga, serta pembayaran memastikan penempatan tersembunyi. Beberapa kata diingat serta dugaan pemakaian ruang bawah tanah tetap belum terjawab.|A defensible resolution can establish the central event while acknowledging residual uncertainty.|Penyelesaian dapat dipertanggungjawabkan dapat memastikan kejadian inti sambil mengakui ketidakpastian tersisa.''')
vf(c,'What happened to Tommy Vale in 2002?','Apa yang terjadi pada Tommy Vale pada 2002?','An undisclosed private placement was concealed behind a later runaway account','Penempatan privat tersembunyi ditutupi cerita kabur belakangan',[('The official label alone proves he independently ran away','Label resmi saja membuktikan ia kabur mandiri'),('The basement photograph proves a fatal confinement','Foto ruang bawah tanah membuktikan penahanan fatal'),('A common pendant alone establishes the whole event','Liontin umum saja memastikan seluruh kejadian')],'Independently preserved authorization, transport and receipt records reconstruct the transfer.','Catatan izin, transportasi, serta kuitansi tersimpan independen merekonstruksi pemindahan.')
vf(c,'Which adult identity is independently supported?','Identitas dewasa mana didukung independen?','Daniel Reed, through documented continuity and consented family comparison','Daniel Reed, melalui kesinambungan terdokumentasi serta pembandingan keluarga berizin',[('Any person with a similar pendant','Siapa pun dengan liontin serupa'),('A person named only in a suggestive interview','Orang yang hanya disebut pada wawancara sugestif'),('No identity can be investigated unless memory is perfect','Tidak ada identitas bisa diselidiki kecuali ingatan sempurna')],'The identity conclusion joins independent records and consensual corroboration.','Kesimpulan identitas menggabungkan catatan independen serta penguatan dengan persetujuan.')
vf(c,'Who is supported in the unauthorized transfer and false reporting?','Siapa didukung terlibat dalam pemindahan tanpa izin serta pelaporan palsu?','Helena authorized and benefited; Gareth transported and knowingly amended the account','Helena mengizinkan serta mendapat manfaat; Gareth mengangkut serta dengan sadar mengubah keterangan',[('Every former caregiver equally','Semua mantan pengasuh secara sama'),('Lena because her account includes uncertainty','Lena karena keterangannya memuat ketidakpastian'),('Marian solely because she provided care','Marian hanya karena memberi perawatan')],'Signed roles, authenticated omission instructions and financial records support distinct responsibilities.','Peran bertanda tangan, instruksi penghilangan terautentikasi, serta catatan keuangan mendukung tanggung jawab berbeda.')
vf(c,'How should Lena’s memories be interpreted?','Bagaimana ingatan Lena perlu ditafsirkan?','As meaningful leads with source-specific corroboration and acknowledged uncertainty','Sebagai petunjuk bermakna dengan penguatan khusus sumber serta ketidakpastian diakui',[('As a perfect recording of every detail','Sebagai rekaman sempurna semua detail'),('As deliberate fabrication because one detail has a later source','Sebagai rekayasa sengaja karena satu detail bersumber belakangan'),('As evidence that requires a recovered-memory technique','Sebagai bukti yang memerlukan teknik pemulihan memori')],'The door has corroboration; the pendant has a plausible later source. Neither requires discrediting the witness.','Pintu memiliki penguatan; liontin memiliki sumber belakangan yang masuk akal. Keduanya tidak memerlukan mendiskreditkan saksi.')
vf(c,'What remains unresolved by the surviving record?','Apa yang tetap belum terjawab oleh catatan tersisa?','Some overheard wording and the alleged use of the basement as confinement','Sebagian kata terdengar serta dugaan ruang bawah tanah dipakai menahan',[('Whether a private transfer was authorized by Helena','Apakah pemindahan privat diizinkan Helena'),('Whether the transport statement was amended','Apakah keterangan transportasi diubah'),('Whether independent receiving records exist','Apakah catatan penerimaan independen ada')],'The central transfer can be established without overstating uncertain subjective and physical details.','Pemindahan inti dapat dipastikan tanpa melebihkan detail subjektif serta fisik yang belum pasti.')
tool(c,'archive',5,'Historical archive and source timeline','Arsip historis serta linimasa sumber','Compare contemporaneous records, later amendments and the history of the witness’s information exposure. Missing or vivid details are not automatic proof either way.','Bandingkan catatan sezaman, perubahan belakangan, serta riwayat paparan informasi saksi. Detail hilang atau jelas bukan bukti otomatis ke arah mana pun.',[
('14 May 2002 · originals','14 Mei 2002 · dokumen asli','Missing report, private T-14 authorization and initial transport carbon describe the same date from different independent archives.','Laporan hilang, izin privat T-14, serta karbon transportasi awal menjelaskan tanggal sama dari arsip independen berbeda.'),('Later amendment','Perubahan belakangan','The police version removes the private journey. Its signature follows the director’s independently archived omission instruction. Compare source order before accepting the runaway label.','Versi polisi menghapus perjalanan privat. Tanda tangannya mengikuti instruksi penghilangan direktur yang diarsipkan independen. Bandingkan urutan sumber sebelum menerima label kabur.'),('Adult recollection sources','Sumber ingatan dewasa','The first preserved note includes a metal door. The common pendant appears after documented archive-photo exposure. Preserve both the lead and the uncertainty.','Catatan tersimpan pertama memuat pintu logam. Liontin umum muncul setelah paparan foto arsip terdokumentasi. Pertahankan petunjuk serta ketidakpastiannya.'),('Independent continuity','Kesinambungan independen','Receiving receipt and clinic correspondence create a documentary route beyond memory. Personal identity assessment still requires consent and independently verified comparison.','Kuitansi penerima serta korespondensi klinik membentuk rute dokumen di luar ingatan. Penilaian identitas pribadi tetap memerlukan persetujuan serta pembandingan terverifikasi independen.')],['E18-12','E18-13','E18-14'])
# Give every Volume III character a source-dependent fourth interview branch.
for c in cases:
 if c['id']<13:continue
 for i,ch in enumerate(c['characters']):
  stage=min(len(c['scenes'])-1,1+i)
  ref=next(e for e in c['evidence'] if e['stage']==stage)
  ch['evidenceRef']=ref['id']
  ch['responses'][2]=L('Check the independent record '+ref['id']+' before relying on my interpretation. Preserve the distinction between what I observed and what I inferred.','Periksa catatan independen '+ref['id']+' sebelum mengandalkan tafsir saya. Pertahankan perbedaan antara yang saya amati dan yang saya simpulkan.')
  ch['responses'][3]=L('With that source available, compare it directly against my account: '+ref['body']['en'],'Dengan sumber itu tersedia, bandingkan langsung terhadap keterangan saya: '+ref['body']['id'])
